{"products":[{"id":9760657178891,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda  BETTY 43W, 4 Cercuri, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-betty-43w-4-cercuri-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/16.._BANNER.png?v=1775007512\" alt=\"\"\u003eAceasta lustra LED moderna Betty, 43W, alba, are 4 cercuri luminoase si ofera iluminare versatila, potrivita pentru living, dormitor sau bucatarie.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eCaracteristici principale:\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"ul1\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"li3\"\u003e\n\u003cb\u003ePutere:\u003c\/b\u003e 43W, pentru iluminare eficienta.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"li3\"\u003e\n\u003cb\u003eTip de lumina:\u003c\/b\u003e Reglabila – rece, calda si neutra (3000K, 4000K, 6000K).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"li3\"\u003e\n\u003cb\u003eDimabila:\u003c\/b\u003e Intensitatea luminii se ajusteaza din telecomanda inclusa.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"li3\"\u003e\n\u003cb\u003eDesign:\u003c\/b\u003e Modern, cu 4 cercuri minimaliste.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"li3\"\u003e\n\u003cb\u003eControl:\u003c\/b\u003e Telecomanda pentru ajustarea temperaturii si intensitatii luminii; functioneaza si cu intrerupatorul clasic (apasari succesive schimba tipul de lumina).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"li3\"\u003e\n\u003cb\u003eFlux luminos:\u003c\/b\u003e 3440 lm.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"li3\"\u003e\n\u003cb\u003eDurata de viata:\u003c\/b\u003e Aproximativ 25.000 ore.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"li3\"\u003e\n\u003cb\u003eMateriale:\u003c\/b\u003e Metal si acril.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"li1\"\u003e\n\u003cb\u003eMontaj:\u003c\/b\u003e Instalare usoara, cu instructiuni incluse.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eLustra LED Betty combina un design curat cu functionalitatea moderna, fiind o solutie de iluminat eficienta energetic si adaptabila oricarui spatiu.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eVezi video demonstrativ\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"row center w-100\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\" class=\"col-12 col-md-6\"\u003e\u003ciframe title=\"Video demonstratie Lustra LED cu Telecomanda Betty 43W 4 Cercuri Lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra Dimabila Alb\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 315px; border: 0;\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/swW59QgqgQw\"\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\" class=\"col-12 col-md-6\"\u003e\u003ciframe title=\"Video montaj Lustra LED cu Telecomanda Betty 43W 4 Cercuri Lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra Dimabila Alb\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 315px; border: 0;\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/F-IOcmWq2PE\"\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-25T03:03:39+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-25T03:03:38+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Ciresar 25","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52428747243787,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT800\/4WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"119.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"119.99","position":1,"product_id":9760657178891,"created_at":"2025-09-30T15:27:16+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"im