2W Lumina Rece Negru","handle":"plafoniera-led-solis-37cm-32w-lumina-rece-negru","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlafoniera LED SOLIS\u003c\/strong\u003e 37cm cu finisaj negru mat este alegerea perfecta pentru interioare moderne si industriale. Cu lumina \u003cstrong\u003erece \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e(6000K)\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e si tehnologie LED \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e32W\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, aceasta plafoniera ofera un iluminat puternic si eficient pentru \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eholuri, birouri si dormitoare\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p3\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e✅ \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb\u003eCaracteristici principale\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"Apple-tab-span\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e•\u003cspan class=\"Apple-tab-span\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eDesign modern\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e cu finisaj negru mat elegant\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"Apple-tab-span\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e•\u003cspan class=\"Apple-tab-span\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eLumina rece \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e(6000K)\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, perfecta pentru orice ambient\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"Apple-tab-span\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e•\u003cspan class=\"Apple-tab-span\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eTehnologie LED 32W\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, eficienta energetica ridicata\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"Apple-tab-span\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e•\u003cspan class=\"Apple-tab-span\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eDiametru 37cm\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, potrivit pentru incaperi mai mari\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p4\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"Apple-tab-span\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e•\u003cspan class=\"Apple-tab-span\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eUsor de instalat\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, ideal pentru uz rezidential si comercial\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p3\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e📌 \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb\u003eAplicatii\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e: potrivita pentru \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb\u003estiluri industriale, minimaliste si contemporane\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-25T03:45:19+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-25T03:45:19+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Plafoniere LED","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Plafoniere LED"],"variants":[{"id":52428571246859,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-PL100\/37BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"79.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"79.99","position":1,"product_id":9760898580747,"created_at":"2025-09-30T14:26:24+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":52756347584779,"created_at":"2025-04-01T13:40:26+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-08-20T10:30:03+03:00","product_id":9760898580747,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Plafoniera_LED_SOLIS_37cm_32W_Lumina_Rece_Negru_2.jpg?v=1787211003","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":52756512801035,"created_at":"2025-04-01T13:47:07+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-08-20T10:30:12+03:00","product_id":9760898580747,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Plafoniera_LED_SOLIS_37cm_32W_Lumina_Rece_Negru_3.jpg?v=1787211012","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":52756347289867,"created_at":"2025-04-01T13:40:26+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-08-20T10:30:22+03:00","product_id":9760898580747,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Plafoniera_LED_SOLIS_37cm_32W_Lumina_Rece_Negru_4.jpg?v=1787211022","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51856181690635,"created_at":"2025-02-25T03:45:20+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-08-20T10:30:30+03:00","product_id":9760898580747,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Plafoniera_LED_SOLIS_37cm_32W_Lumina_Rece_Negru_5.webp?v=1787211030","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69955562209547,"created_at":"2026-08-20T10:29:18+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-08-20T10:30:42+03:00","product_id":9760898580747,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Plafoniera_LED_SOLIS_37cm_32W_Lumina_Rece_Negru_6ChatGPTImageAug20_2026_10_29_02AM.png?v=1787211042","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69517525549323,"created_at":"2026-06-16T13:32:19+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-08-20T10:30:51+03:00","product_id":9760898580747,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Plafoniera_LED_SOLIS_37cm_32W_Lumina_Rece_Negru_7.png?v=1787211051","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69959170687243,"created_at":"2026-08-21T10:15:37+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-08-21T10:15:39+03:00","product_id":9760898580747,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Label_2547040_big_color.png?v=1787296539","width":425,"height":850}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757486514443,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda  BETTY 127W, 8 Cercuri, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-betty-127w-8-cercuri-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"187\" data-end=\"212\"\u003eLustra LED BETTY 127W\u003c\/strong\u003e îmbină perfect designul modern cu performanța luminoasă de top, devenind instant punctul central al oricărui interior. Formată din \u003cstrong data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"376\"\u003eopt cercuri dispuse simetric\u003c\/strong\u003e, la înălțimi și dimensiuni variate, această lustra nu funcționează doar ca sursă de lumină, ci ca \u003cstrong data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"505\"\u003epiesă decorativă statement\u003c\/strong\u003e, capabilă să ridice nivelul estetic al oricărui spațiu.\u003cp data-start=\"187\" data-end=\"561\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"862\"\u003eFiecare cerc integrează \u003cstrong data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"619\"\u003ebenzi LED de înaltă calitate\u003c\/strong\u003e, care distribuie lumina uniform și confortabil, fără zone întunecate. Cu o putere totală de \u003cstrong data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"720\"\u003e127W\u003c\/strong\u003e și un flux luminos impresionant de \u003cstrong data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"769\"\u003e10.160 lm\u003c\/strong\u003e, BETTY este ideală pentru livinguri spațioase, dormitoare mari, birouri sau zone open-space.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"862\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"907\"\u003e💡 Eficiență ridicată și confort vizual\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"1273\"\u003eTehnologia LED avansată asigură un consum redus de energie și o durată de viață extinsă, oferind în același timp o iluminare puternică și stabilă. Poți ajusta cu ușurință temperatura de culoare – \u003cstrong data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1130\"\u003e3000K, 4000K sau 6000K\u003c\/strong\u003e –, pentru a trece în câteva secunde de la o lumină caldă, relaxantă, la una neutră sau rece, perfectă pentru activități ce necesită claritate.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"1273\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1314\"\u003e🎮 Control complet prin telecomandă\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1638\"\u003eFuncțiile inteligente permit reglarea intensității luminii prin modul \u003cstrong data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1397\"\u003edimmable\u003c\/strong\u003e, pentru ca atmosfera să fie mereu așa cum o dorești. Telecomanda îți oferă acces rapid la schimbarea temperaturii de culoare, adaptând iluminatul în funcție de moment, activitate sau preferințe. Totul se face simplu, intuitiv și fără efort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1638\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1684\"\u003e📐 Design modern și integrare impecabilă\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1941\"\u003eCu un finisaj \u003cstrong data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1710\"\u003ealb mat\u003c\/strong\u003e, lustra BETTY se integrează perfect în decoruri moderne, minimaliste sau contemporane. Materialele premium – metal și acril – asigură rezistență, stabilitate și un aspect elegant pe termen lung.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T16:29:39+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T16:29:38+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate"],"variants":[{"id":52359957938443,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"o