mabila_Alb_14.png?v=1788871460","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":55702754361611,"created_at":"2025-05-23T12:41:54+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-09-08T15:44:31+03:00","product_id":9757486514443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_telecomanda_BETTY_127W_8_Cercuri_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Alb_15.webp?v=1788871471","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":63040377618699,"created_at":"2025-12-05T15:47:32+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-08T15:44:42+03:00","product_id":9757486514443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_telecomanda_BETTY_127W_8_Cercuri_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Alb_16.png?v=1788871482","width":2000,"height":1939},{"id":69702203506955,"created_at":"2026-07-06T13:52:13+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-09-08T15:44:52+03:00","product_id":9757486514443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_telecomanda_BETTY_127W_8_Cercuri_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Alb_17.png?v=1788871492","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":70068188709131,"created_at":"2026-09-08T15:25:20+03:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2026-09-08T15:45:04+03:00","product_id":9757486514443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_telecomanda_BETTY_127W_8_Cercuri_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Alb_18Label_2547002_big_color.png?v=1788871504","width":425,"height":850}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757273358603,"title":"Lustra Forma Diamant, STRUKTUR, 1xE27, Negru, Metal","handle":"lustra-forma-diamant-geo-uno-1xe27-negru-metal","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:267\"\u003eAdauga o nota de indrazneala industriala si eleganta contemporana spatiului tau. Pendulul 'STRUKTUR' cu forma de diamant nu este doar o sursa de lumina, ci o sculptura suspendata, proiectata sa captiveze privirile si sa infuzeze orice ambient cu un caracter distinct.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:208\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Aparte, Geometrie Curata:\u003c\/strong\u003e Inspirata de claritatea unui diamant, structura sa metalica neagra, cu forme geometrice bine definite, ofera un impact vizual puternic si o estetica moderna inegalabila.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:194\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePunct Focal Luminos:\u003c\/strong\u003e Echipata cu un singur soclu E27, aceasta piesa centrala creeaza o iluminare de accent fermecatoare, subliniind zonele cheie si generand o atmosfera calda si invitanta.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:198\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAdaptabilitate Urbana si Rustica:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ideala pentru a complimenta veranda, foisorul, terasa sau bucataria, pendulul se integreaza perfect in decoruri variate, de la cele industriale la cele boeme.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"8:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDimensiuni echilibrate, Impact Maxim:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu un diametru de 27 cm si o inaltime de 100 cm (cu fir), permite ajustarea pentru a crea efectul vizual dorit, transformand spatiul intr-unul memorabil.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:149\"\u003eAcest pendul nu doar lumineaza functional, ci si eleveaza designul ambiental, transformand fiecare colt intr-o zona cu personalitate si stil rafinat.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T15:17:22+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T15:17:21+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Industrial","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre cu bec","Lustre din fier","Lustre Minimaliste"],"variants":[{"id":52415781699851,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-CH1A-HT2L-6630\/1","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"42.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"42.99","position":1,"product_id":9757273358603,"created_at":"2025-09-26T17:49:08+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51814188876043,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:17:25+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T15:17:27+02:00","product_id":9757273358603,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-diamant_PE1242_01.webp?v=1740403047","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51814188744971,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:17:25+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T15:17:27+02:00","product_id":9757273358603,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-diamant_PE1242_02.webp?v=1740403047","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51814189203723,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:17:25+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T15:17:28+02:00","product_id":9757273358603,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-diamant_PE1242_03.webp?v=1740403048","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51814188548363,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:17:25+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T15:17:27+02:00","product_id":9757273358603,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-diamant_PE1242_04.webp?v=1740403047","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51814188482827,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:17:25+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T15:17:27+02:00","product_id":9757273358603,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-diamant_PE1242_05.webp?v=1740403047","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757724934411,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda LOTUS 32W, 3 Petale, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-lotus-32w-3-petale-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cstyle\u003e.containerimg-mobile,.containerimg {    text-align: center;    margin-left: auto;    margin-right: auto;}.img2 {    width: 100%;}p.paragraf-descrieri {    font-size: 135%;    text-align: justify;    width: 80%;    margin-left: auto;    margin-right: auto;}.video-link {    position: relative;    display: block;    width: 100%;    max-width: 560px;    margin: 0 auto;    height: 0;    padding-bottom: 40%; \/* Adjusted aspect ratio for less height *\/    overflow: hidden;}.video-link img {    position: absolute;    top: 0;    left: 0;    width: 100%;    height: 100%;}\u003c\/style\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"containerimg-mobile\" style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"358\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"120\"\u003eLustra LED cu telecomanda\u003c\/strong\u003e, aplicata, cu forma rotunda si design discret, potrivita pentru \u003cstrong data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"211\"\u003ebaie, hol sau dressing\u003c\/strong\u003e. Functioneaza pe baza de \u003cstrong data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"250\"\u003ebanda LED\u003c\/strong\u003e si permite selectarea temperaturii de culoare – \u003cstrong data-start=\"299\" data-end=\"332\"\u003elumina calda, neutra sau rece\u003c\/strong\u003e – direct din telecomanda.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"358\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAsigura \u003cstrong data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"416\"\u003eiluminare eficienta cu un consum de doar 32W\u003c\/strong\u003e, avand o durata de viata de \u003cstrong data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"462\"\u003e25.000 de ore\u003c\/strong\u003e. Este compatibila cu retele electrice de \u003cstrong data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"516\"\u003e220-230V\u003c\/strong\u003e ideala pentru spatii interioare.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"358\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eDimensiuni compacte – perfecte pentru incaperi cu tavan jos. Se monteaza usor, iar \u003cstrong data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"728\"\u003estilul modern si functional\u003c\/strong\u003e o face o alegere practica pentru orice locuinta.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:277\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Ideala_pentru_Holuri.jpg?v=1741710546\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2026-04-07T16:00:06+03:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T17:56:16+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52427636736267,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT660\/3WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"175.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"175.99","position":1,"product_id":9757724934411,"created_at":"2025-09-30T09:45:53+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":70026961617163,"created_at":"2026-09-02T13:45:28+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:46:50+03:00","product_id":9757724934411,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_telecomanda_LOTUS_32W_3_Petale_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Alb_1.png?v=1788346010","width":1026,"height":1026},{"id":70061540278539,"created_at":"2026-09-07T09:33:46+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-07T09:34:25+03:00","product_id":9757724934411,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_telecomanda_LOTUS_32W_3_Petale_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Alb_12.png?v=1788762865","width":1275,"height":1234},{"id":69925236441355,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:15:09+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-08-14T15:15:12+03:00","product_id":9757724934411,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/007_LT660-3WH_x01_f874122f-6133-429a-b0b3-42fd665af54e.webp?v=1786709712","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69925236375819,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:15:09+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-08-14T15:15:11+03:00","product_id":9757724934411,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/005_LT660-3WH_size.webp?v=1786709711","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69925236277515,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:15:09+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-08-14T15:15:12+03:00","product_id":9757724934411,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/002_LT660-3WH_cover.webp?v=1786709712","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69925236310283,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:15:09+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-08-14T15:15:12+03:00","product_id":9757724934411,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/003_LT660-3WH_dimming.webp?v=1786709712","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69925236343051,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:15:09+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-08-14T15:15:12+03:00","product_id":9757724934411,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/004_LT660-3WH_night.webp?v=1786709712","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69925236408587,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:15:09+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-08-14T15:15:12+03:00","product_id":9757724934411,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/006_LT660-3WH_tone.webp?v=1786709712","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":70026957685003,"created_at":"2026-09-02T13:43:55+03:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:43:57+03:00","product_id":9757724934411,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Label_2522271_big_color.png?v=1788345837","width":425,"height":850}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9759584551179,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda SAKURA 38W, 3 Petale, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb, Metal si Acril","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-sakura-37w-3-petale-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDescopera eleganta moderna a lustrei LED SAKURA, un corp de iluminat care imbina perfect designul contemporan cu functionalitatea avansata. Cu forma sa inspirata din linii naturale, aceasta lustra va deveni punctul de atractie al dormitorului sau zonei tale de dining.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eDesign Modern si Spatios\u003c\/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eCele trei brate cu linii fluide se unesc armonios intr-o compozitie moderna de 60 cm diametru. Profilul subtire de 8.5 cm si finisajul alb elegant se integreaza perfect in orice interior contemporan, oferind o prezenta distinctiva pe tavan.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/www.alessandrodesign.ro\/upload\/userfiles\/images\/documentations\/banners\/banner_iluminat_perfect.webp\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eControl Intuitiv al Luminii\u003c\/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eCu ajutorul telecomenzii, poti adapta usor atmosfera incaperii tale. Alege intre lumina calda (3000K) pentru momente relaxante, lumina neutra (4000K) pentru activitati zilnice, sau lumina rece (6000K) pentru claritate maxima. Functia de dimming iti permite sa ajustezi intensitatea luminii dupa preferinte.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e Beneficii principale:\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Iluminare puternica si uniforma cu 2880 lumeni \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Control convenabil prin telecomanda si intrerupator\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Durata de viata extinsa de 25.000 ore\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Consum eficient de energie de 36W • Instalare simpla pe tavan\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSAKURA este alegerea perfecta pentru cei care apreciaza designul modern si doresc flexibilitate in controlul iluminatului. Ideala pentru crearea ambiantei potrivite in timpul cinelor in familie sau pentru momentele de relaxare in dormitor.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c!-- notionvc: 76e17c57-2ac0-44b4-85eb-ab34e14e05d3 --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-25T00:08:01+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-25T00:08:01+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52428506235147,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT620\/3WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"115.79","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"149.99","position":1,"product_id":9759584551179,"created_at":"2025-09-30T14:06:57+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51834370523403,"created_at":"2025-02-25T00:08:02+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-03-13T23:23:19+02:00","product_id":9759584551179,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-zahra-60w-dimabila-alb_LL1905AL_01.webp?v=1741900999","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":62947186376971,"created_at":"2025-12-02T17:10:29+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-12-02T17:11:59+02:00","product_id":9759584551179,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/510wZphpIvL._AC_SL1200.jpg?v=1764688319","width":1200,"height":1200},{"id":62947185557771,"created_at":"2025-12-02T17:10:21+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-12-02T17:11:59+02:00","product_id":9759584551179,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT6203WH_1.png?v=1764688319","width":1586,"height":1586},{"id":52336834806027,"created_at":"2025-03-13T23:36:42+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-12-02T17:11:59+02:00","product_id":9759584551179,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT620_3-img2.webp?v=1764688319","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":62947185492235,"created_at":"2025-12-02T17:10:20+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-12-02T17:11:59+02:00","product_id":9759584551179,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT6203WH_2.png?v=1764688319","width":800,"height":800},{"id":62947186442507,"created_at":"2025-12-02T17:10:29+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-12-02T17:11:59+02:00","product_id":9759584551179,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/61NgxNauzSL._AC_SL1108.jpg?v=1764688319","width":1107,"height":1108},{"id":65645255885067,"created_at":"2026-02-12T18:05:12+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-07-07T09:17:29+03:00","product_id":9759584551179,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT620_3WH.webp?v=1783405049","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69707815878923,"created_at":"2026-07-07T09:15:01+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-07-07T09:15:03+03:00","product_id":9759584551179,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Label_2736173_big_color.png?v=1783404903","width":425,"height":850}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757472489739,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda TULIP 81W, 5 Petale, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-tulip-73w-5-petale-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eDescopera noua lustra LED cu telecomanda TULIP, un model premium din colectia noastra de lustre LED living. Acest corp de iluminat modern combina designul elegant cu tehnologia avansata, oferind o solutie completa pentru iluminatul casei tale.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eTehnologie Avansata pentru Confort Maxim\u003c\/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eDin gama exclusiva de lustre cu LED si telecomanda, acest model este o lustra LED dimabila cu telecomanda si 3 functii, oferind control total asupra ambientului. Alege intre lumina calda (3000K) pentru seri relaxante, cea neutra (4000K) pentru activitati zilnice sau rece (6000K) pentru maximum de claritate. Cu un flux luminos impresionant de 5342 lumeni, aceasta lustra asigura iluminarea perfecta a spatiilor mari.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led.webp?v=1734528553\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eDesign Modern cu Impact Vizual\u003c\/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eCele 5 petale dispuse armonios fac din acest model una dintre cele mai elegante lustre LED disponibile. Cu dimensiuni generoase de 75 cm diametru si un profil elegant de 13 cm, acest model din colectia lustre LED devine o prezenta impunatoare dar rafinata. Finisajul alb se integreaza perfect in orice stil de amenajare moderna.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e Caracteristici esentiale:\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Control intuitiv prin telecomanda si intrerupator clasic\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Functie de dimming pentru adaptarea perfecta a luminozitatii\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Putere optima de 81W pentru eficienta energetica\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Durata de viata extinsa de 25.000 ore\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Protectie IP20 pentru utilizare sigura la interior\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/www.alessandrodesign.ro\/upload\/userfiles\/images\/documentations\/banners\/banner_telecomanda_lustra_led.webp\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTransforma-ti livingul sau dormitorul cu aceasta lustra LED dimabila cu telecomanda. Design-ul sau contemporan si performantele tehnice superioare fac din TULIP alegerea perfecta pentru iluminatul modern al casei tale.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/www.alessandrodesign.ro\/upload\/userfiles\/images\/documentations\/banners\/banner_mod_noapte_lustra_led.webp\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\n\u003c!-- notionvc: 7ce582c9-d0a0-4a24-a821-1a54be705423 --\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T16:24:06+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T16:24:05+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52423820050699,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT901\/5WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"179.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"179.99","position":1,"product_id":9757472489739,"created_at":"2025-09-29T11:25:44+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":70027152785675,"created_at":"2026-09-02T14:52:39+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-02T14:53:29+03:00","product_id":9757472489739,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_telecomanda_TULIP_81W_5_Petale_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Alb_1.png?v=1788350009","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69701417599243,"created_at":"2026-07-06T11:04:31+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-07-06T11:04:36+03:00","product_id":9757472489739,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage6iul.2026_11_04_22.png?v=1783325076","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":51815843660043,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:24:08+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-06-08T14:05:52+03:00","product_id":9757472489739,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-pamela-120w-dimabila-alb_LL11AL_05.webp?v=1780916752","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":54970332578059,"created_at":"2025-04-24T15:13:26+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-12-03T17:04:48+02:00","product_id":9757472489739,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-pamela-120w-dimabila-alb_LL11AL_06.jpg?v=1764774288","width":2048,"height":2048},{"id":51815843430667,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:24:08+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-06-08T14:14:38+03:00","product_id":9757472489739,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-pamela-120w-dimabila-alb_LL11AL_04.webp?v=1780917278","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":52337909039371,"created_at":"2025-03-14T01:22:15+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-04-24T15:13:50+03:00","product_id":9757472489739,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/IMG_4581_2.jpg?v=1745496830","width":800,"height":800},{"id":64308754120971,"created_at":"2026-01-12T11:27:05+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-01-12T11:27:08+02:00","product_id":9757472489739,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT901_5WH_EPREL.png?v=1768210028","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9759840895243,"title":"Lustra LED VERTEX Flow 24W, Diametru 25cm, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-vertex-flow-24w-diametru-25cm-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-alb","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:331\"\u003eLustra LED VERTEX Flow, cu o putere de 24W și un diametru compact de 25cm, este o soluție de iluminat modernă și discretă, ideală pentru spații mai mici sau ca iluminat complementar. Designul său 'Flow' sugerează linii fluide și un aspect aerisit, iar finisajul alb îi conferă versatilitate, integrându-se ușor în diverse decoruri.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:278\"\u003eDeși compactă, această lustră oferă flexibilitatea de a alege temperatura de culoare a luminii. Poți opta pentru lumină rece, pentru a crea o atmosferă energizantă, lumină caldă, pentru un ambient primitor și relaxant, sau lumină neutră, pentru o iluminare generală echilibrată.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:313\"\u003eCu o putere de 24W, asigură o iluminare eficientă pentru dimensiunea sa, fiind potrivită pentru holuri, băi, dressing-uri sau ca parte a unui sistem de iluminat mai complex în camere mai mari. Diametrul de 25cm o face potrivită pentru a nu domina vizual spațiul, ci pentru a oferi o lumină plăcută și funcțională.\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Ideala_pentru_Holuri.jpg?v=1741710546\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-25T00:48:23+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-25T00:48:23+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED Aplicate","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED Scandinave"],"variants":[{"id":52427656986891,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-CH1A-HT2L-3065WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"89.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"89.99","position":1,"product_id":9759840895243,"created_at":"2025-09-30T09:56:14+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51838279155979,"created_at":"2025-02-25T00:48:25+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-25T00:48:26+02:00","product_id":9759840895243,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-julieta-24w-alb_LL1934AL_01.webp?v=1740437306","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51838279123211,"created_at":"2025-02-25T00:48:25+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-02-25T00:48:26+02:00","product_id":9759840895243,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-julieta-24w-alb_LL1934AL_02.webp?v=1740437306","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757262971147,"title":"Lustra Forma Diamant, STRUKTUR, 3xE27, Negru, Metal","handle":"lustra-forma-diamant-geo-trio-3xe27-negru-metal","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:290\"\u003eLustra Forma Diamant STRUKTUR nu este doar un corp de iluminat, ci o instalatie artistica, conceputa sa devina piesa centrala a bucatariei sau holului, redefinind spatiul cu o estetica moderna si indrazneata.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:217\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTrio de Eleganta Industriala:\u003c\/strong\u003e Trei pandantive cu abajururi metalice in forma de diamant, finisate in negru mat, creeaza un ansamblu vizual dinamic, oferind o interpretare contemporana a stilului industrial-chic.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:256\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIluminare Ampla si Dirijata:\u003c\/strong\u003e Echipata cu trei socluri E27, aceasta lustra inunda zona de sub ea cu o lumina puternica, ideala pentru insulele de bucatarie, blaturile de lucru sau zonele de trecere, oferind claritate si ambianta.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:232\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eArmonie in Detaliu:\u003c\/strong\u003e Constructia robusta din metal si suspendarea pe lanturi confera un aer autentic si o durabilitate remarcabila, in timp ce designul sau permite integrarea fluida in decoruri minimaliste sau eclectic-moderne.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"8:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProportii Perfecte pentru Spatii Cheie:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu un diametru de 20 cm per abajur, o inaltime totala de 95 cm si o lungime de 50 cm, este gandita sa completeze estetic si functional spatiile din bucatarie sau hol, fara a le incarca.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:167\"\u003eAceasta lustra transforma fiecare moment intr-o experienta vizuala placuta si un spatiu plin de personalitate.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T15:12:08+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T15:12:07+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Industrial","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre cu bec","Lustre din fier","Lustre Minimaliste"],"variants":[{"id":52429418725643,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-CH1A-HT2L-6630\/3L","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"139.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"139.99","position":1,"product_id":9757262971147,"created_at":"2025-09-30T16:15:36+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51814070124811,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:12:10+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T15:12:12+02:00","product_id":9757262971147,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-diamant-3xe27_PE1232_01.webp?v=1740402732","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51814070321419,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:12:10+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T15:12:12+02:00","product_id":9757262971147,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-diamant-3xe27_PE1232_02.webp?v=1740402732","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51814070092043,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:12:10+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T15:12:12+02:00","product_id":9757262971147,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-diamant-3xe27_PE1232_03.webp?v=1740402732","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51814070583563,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:12:10+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T15:12:13+02:00","product_id":9757262971147,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-diamant-3xe27_PE1232_04.webp?v=1740402733","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51814070223115,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:12:10+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T15:12:12+02:00","product_id":9757262971147,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-diamant-3xe27_PE1232_05.webp?v=1740402732","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9756897083659,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda LOTUS 54W, 5 Petale, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-lotus-54w-5-petale-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cdiv class=\"containerimg\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"chat-history-scroll-container\" id=\"chat-history\"\u003e\u003cdiv id=\"7e6b62913d6ba439\" class=\"conversation-container message-actions-hover-boundary tts-removed ng-star-inserted\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container ng-tns-c3043829428-119 response-container-with-gpi is-mobile tts-removed ng-star-inserted response-container-has-multiple-responses\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"presented-response-container ng-tns-c3043829428-119\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container-content ng-tns-c3043829428-119\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-content ng-tns-c3043829428-119\"\u003e\u003cdiv dir=\"ltr\" id=\"model-response-message-contentr_7e6b62913d6ba439\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:78\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEleganță Florală și Iluminare Inteligentă: Lustra LED cu Telecomandă LOTUS\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:276\"\u003eÎmbracă-ți spațiul cu o notă de delicatețe și modernitate cu lustra LED LOTUS. Designul său inspirat de forma unei flori de lotus, cu \u003cstrong\u003e5 petale\u003c\/strong\u003e stilizate, aduce un aer proaspăt și elegant în orice încăpere. Finisajul \u003cstrong\u003ealb\u003c\/strong\u003e pur accentuează liniile fluide și luminozitatea.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:276\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:398\"\u003eCu o putere de \u003cstrong\u003e54W\u003c\/strong\u003e, această lustră LED oferă o iluminare eficientă și versatilă. Datorită \u003cstrong\u003etelecomenzii incluse\u003c\/strong\u003e, ai control complet asupra atmosferei luminoase. Poți alege între \u003cstrong\u003elumină rece\u003c\/strong\u003e, ideală pentru activități care necesită concentrare; \u003cstrong\u003elumină caldă\u003c\/strong\u003e, perfectă pentru a crea un ambient primitor și relaxant; și \u003cstrong\u003elumină neutră\u003c\/strong\u003e, potrivită pentru iluminatul general de zi cu zi.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:398\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:184\"\u003eFuncția \u003cstrong\u003edimabilă\u003c\/strong\u003e îți permite să ajustezi intensitatea luminoasă, creând astfel ambientul perfect pentru fiecare moment, de la o lumină strălucitoare la o lumină ambientală subtilă.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:25\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCaracteristici Cheie:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"13:1-21:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:89\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Floral Elegant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Inspirat de forma unei flori de lotus cu 5 petale stilizate.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"14:1-14:54\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePutere Eficientă:\u003c\/strong\u003e 54W pentru o iluminare optimă.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:91\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTelecomanda Inclusă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Control facil al temperaturii culorii și intensității luminoase.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"16:1-16:94\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTrei Temperaturi de Culoare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Rece, Caldă și Neutră, pentru a se potrivi oricărei ocazii.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"17:1-17:88\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFuncție Dimmabilă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ajustează intensitatea luminoasă pentru a crea ambientul dorit.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"18:1-18:79\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFinisaj Alb:\u003c\/strong\u003e Aspect luminos și pur, ușor de integrat în diverse decoruri.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"19:1-19:62\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMateriale de Calitate:\u003c\/strong\u003e Acril durabil și metal rezistent.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"20:1-21:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStil Modern și Delicat:\u003c\/strong\u003e Se integrează perfect în interioare moderne, minimaliste sau cu accente naturale.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"22:1-22:14\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeneficii:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"24:1-29:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"24:1-24:93\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eControl Total al Luminii:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ajustează temperatura culorii și intensitatea cu telecomanda.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"25:1-25:79\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAtmosferă Personalizată:\u003c\/strong\u003e Creează ambientul perfect pentru fiecare moment.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"26:1-26:90\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAspect Estetic Plăcut:\u003c\/strong\u003e Designul floral adaugă o notă de delicatețe și originalitate.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"27:1-27:81\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEficiență Energetică LED:\u003c\/strong\u003e Consum redus de energie și durată de viață lungă.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"28:1-29:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUșor de Utilizat:\u003c\/strong\u003e Telecomanda intuitivă face controlul luminii simplu și confortabil.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led.webp?v=1734528553\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"30:1-30:193\"\u003eLustra LED cu telecomandă LOTUS este alegerea ideală pentru a adăuga un plus de stil, confort și control inteligent în casa ta. Bucură-te de iluminarea adaptabilă și de designul floral elegant!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T12:56:28+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T12:56:27+0