e, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Negru","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-chiara-98w-3-patrate-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-negru","body_html":"\u003cp data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"396\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"129\"\u003eLustra LED CHIARA\u003c\/strong\u003e impresionează printr-un design modern și inovator, transformat într-un element decorativ cu adevărat contemporan. Cele \u003cstrong data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"274\"\u003etrei pătrate elegante\u003c\/strong\u003e, dispuse geometric, creează un efect vizual spectaculos, iar finisajul \u003cstrong data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"359\"\u003enegru mat\u003c\/strong\u003e adaugă o notă de rafinament și stil.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"396\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003eCu o putere generoasă de \u003cstrong\u003e98W\u003c\/strong\u003e, CHIARA oferă o iluminare amplă și eficientă, ideală pentru \u003cstrong data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"564\"\u003elivinguri moderne, dormitoare spațioase, birouri sau zone open-space\u003c\/strong\u003e. LED-urile integrate permit selectarea \u003cstrong data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"631\"\u003etemperaturii de culoare\u003c\/strong\u003e – rece, neutră sau caldă – astfel încât să poți adapta atmosfera exact așa cum dorești.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"719\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"1008\"\u003eTelecomanda inclusă îți oferă control total asupra luminii, atât pentru schimbarea culorii, cât și pentru \u003cstrong data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"873\"\u003ereglarea intensității luminoase (dimmabil)\u003c\/strong\u003e. Poți trece rapid de la o lumină puternică, perfectă pentru activități, la un ambient discret și relaxant, potrivit serilor liniștite.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"1008\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003chr data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1013\"\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1211\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1211\" data-is-last-node=\"\"\u003eCHIARA este alegerea perfectă pentru cei care își doresc o lustra modernă, puternică și versatilă, care combină estetica geometrică cu tehnologia LED și confortul controlului prin telecomandă.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-04-29T15:29:27+03:00","created_at":"2025-04-14T16:41:08+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","NOSINC"],"variants":[{"id":52428101320971,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT633\/500P","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"219.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"219.99","position":1,"product_id":10132808565003,"created_at":"2025-09-30T12:27:26+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69925231853835,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:13:06+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-08-14T15:13:08+03:00","product_id":10132808565003,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/003_LT633-500P_cover.webp?v=1786709588","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69925231821067,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:13:06+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-08-14T15:13:08+03:00","product_id":10132808565003,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/002_LT633-500P_closeup.webp?v=1786709588","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69925232050443,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:13:06+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-08-14T15:13:09+03:00","product_id":10132808565003,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/009_LT633-500P_x01_8bd46cfc-99b5-474d-a856-9de5e644d458.webp?v=1786709589","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69925231886603,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:13:06+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-08-14T15:13:10+03:00","product_id":10132808565003,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/004_LT633-500P_place_bedroom.webp?v=1786709590","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69925231919371,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:13:06+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-08-14T15:13:09+03:00","product_id":10132808565003,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/005_LT633-500P_place_dressing.webp?v=1786709589","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69925231952139,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:13:06+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-08-14T15:13:09+03:00","product_id":10132808565003,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/006_LT633-500P_place_hallway.webp?v=1786709589","width":1086,"height":1448},{"id":69925231984907,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:13:06+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-08-14T15:13:09+03:00","product_id":10132808565003,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/007_LT633-500P_place_living.webp?v=1786709589","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69925232017675,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:13:06+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-08-14T15:13:09+03:00","product_id":10132808565003,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/008_LT633-500P_size.webp?v=1786709589","width":1254,"height":1254}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757504602379,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda ZOE 138W, 8 Patrate, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-zoe-138w-8-patrate-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e“Este atât de ușor să controlezi atmosfera.”\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; width: 100%; max-width: 640px; margin: auto; padding-top: min(360px, 56.25%); text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ciframe style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; right: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/H4KIKoJJF9M?list=PLLgyTjEnUblYjgo5KBGj4gHhPg7l_JqnF\"\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e \u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"494\" data-start=\"122\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"140\" data-start=\"122\"\u003eLustra LED Zoe\u003c\/strong\u003e, parte a gamei \u003cstrong data-end=\"166\" data-start=\"156\"\u003eBalans\u003c\/strong\u003e, este o piesă de iluminat cu adevărat spectaculoasă, concepută pentru a transforma spațiile mari într-un decor modern, armonios și perfect echilibrat. Este o demonstrație clară de măiestrie în design geometric, adresată celor care își doresc un corp de iluminat cu personalitate, dar și cu performanță luminoasă de nivel înalt.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"494\" data-start=\"122\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"881\" data-start=\"496\"\u003eCu o putere impresionantă de \u003cstrong\u003e138W \u003c\/strong\u003eși un flux luminos de \u003cstrong data-end=\"569\" data-start=\"556\"\u003e11.040 lm\u003c\/strong\u003e, Zoe oferă o iluminare amplă, uniformă și eficientă, ideală pentru \u003cstrong data-end=\"700\" data-start=\"637\"\u003elivinguri generoase, lobby-uri de hotel, săli de conferințe\u003c\/strong\u003e sau orice încăpere în care este necesară o lumină puternică și bine distribuită. Lumina emisă este intensă, dar confortabilă vizual, contribuind la un ambient modern și sofisticat.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"881\" data-start=\"496\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1182\" data-start=\"883\"\u003eDesignul său geometric este format din \u003cstrong data-end=\"966\" data-start=\"922\"\u003eopt pătrate – patru mari și patru mici –\u003c\/strong\u003e aranjate simetric pentru a crea o compoziție echilibrată și extrem de expresivă. Structura devine astfel un element decorativ în sine, capabil să atragă privirile și să ofere spațiului un stil arhitectural distinct.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1182\" data-start=\"883\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1444\" data-start=\"1184\"\u003eZoe oferă trei tipuri de lumină: \u003cstrong data-end=\"1266\" data-start=\"1217\"\u003ecaldă (3000K), neutră (4000K) și rece (6000K)\u003c\/strong\u003e, permițând adaptarea atmosferei în funcție de activitate sau momentul zilei. Fie că ai nevoie de relaxare, concentrare sau energie vizuală, lustra oferă flexibilitatea necesară.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1444\" data-start=\"1184\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T16:35:59+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T16:35:59+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52422682509579,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT808\/8WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"179.79","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"199.99","position":1,"product_id":9757504602379,"created_at":"2025-09-28T21:43:38+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":70053284741387,"created_at":"2026-09-04T16:26:18+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-04T16:28:41+03:00","product_id":9757504602379,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_telecomanda_ZOE_138W_8_Patrate_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Alb_1.png?v=1788528521","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":63042070413579,"created_at":"2025-12-05T16:16:40+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-12-05T16:17:00+02:00","product_id":9757504602379,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT8088WH_2.png?v=1764944220","width":1586,"height":1586},{"id":63042070380811,"created_at":"2025-12-05T16:16:39+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-12-05T16:17:00+02:00","product_id":9757504602379,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT8088WH_1.png?v=1764944220","width":800,"height":800},{"id":51816116519179,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:36:02+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-12-05T16:03:11+02:00","product_id":9757504602379,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-darcy-200w-dimabila-alb_1721_05.webp?v=1764943391","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51816116715787,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:36:02+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T16:36:04+02:00","product_id":9757504602379,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-darcy-200w-dimabila-alb_1721_07.webp?v=1740407764","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51816116617483,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:36:02+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-12-05T16:17:00+02:00","product_id":9757504602379,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-darcy-200w-dimabila-alb_1721_06.webp?v=1764944220","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51816116748555,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:36:02+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-04T16:28:21+03:00","product_id":9757504602379,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-darcy-200w-dimabila-alb_1721_02.webp?v=1788528501","width":780,"height":780},{"id":51816116650251,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:36:02+02:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2025-12-05T16:17:00+02:00","product_id":9757504602379,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-darcy-200w-dimabila-alb_1721_03.webp?v=1764944220","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51816116584715,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:36:02+02:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2025-12-05T16:17:00+02:00","product_id":9757504602379,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-darcy-200w-dimabila-alb_1721_04.webp?v=1764944220","width":900,"height":900},{"id":68422408798475,"created_at":"2026-04-22T12:00:27+03:00","position":10,"updated_at":"2026-04-22T12:00:29+03:00","product_id":9757504602379,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Label_2697272_big_color.svg?v=1776848429","width":136,"height":272}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757199008011,"title":"Lustra Roata, 3*E27, Maro, Metal si Sfoara","handle":"lustra-roata-3-e27-maro-metal-si-sfoara","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg\u003e\u003cimg\u003e\u003cimg\u003eLustra Roata nu este doar o sursa de lumina, ci o declaratie de stil, conceputa sa devina punctul central in foisor, veranda sau bucatarie, infuzand fiecare colt cu o caldura naturala si o personalitate robusta.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:246\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Unic, Inspiratie Rustica:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu o structura circulara ce imita o roata, din metal maro, completata de trei pendule impletite din sfoara naturala, aceasta lustra ofera o estetica autentica, amintind de fermecatoarele spatii traditionale.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:243\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLumina Calda, Atmosfera Primitoare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Echipata cu trei socluri E27, Lustra Roata permite utilizarea becurilor LED, economice sau fluorescente, difuzand o lumina ambientala generoasa, ideala pentru a crea o atmosfera relaxanta si invitanta.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:262\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePrezenta Impunatoare, Versatilitate Functionala:\u003c\/strong\u003e Desi ancorata in stilul rustic, designul sau versatil ii permite sa se integreze armonios atat in decoruri traditionale, cat si in cele cu accente industriale sau boeme, aducand un echilibru vizual de efect.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"8:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConstructie Solida, Caracter Durabil:\u003c\/strong\u003e Realizata din metal si sfoara, ofera o durabilitate remarcabila si o estetica autentica, care imbatraneste frumos, transformand un simplu spatiu intr-unul cu suflet si poveste.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:191\"\u003eAceasta lustra nu doar lumineaza functional, ci imbraca spatiul cu un spirit rural chic, transformand fiecare moment intr-o experienta vizuala placuta si un spatiu cu un farmec inconfundabil.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:191\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e*Becurile nu sunt incluse!\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:191\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-candelabre-bec-e27.jpg?v=1747387419\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T14:33:30+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T14:33:29+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Vintage","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre cu bec","Lustre Vintage"],"variants":[{"id":52408051630347,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-CH1A-HT2L-8155\/3","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"159.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"159.99","position":1,"product_id":9757199008011,"created_at":"2025-09-24T12:03:49+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51813421744395,"created_at":"2025-02-24T14:33:32+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T14:33:34+02:00","product_id":9757199008011,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-roata-3e27-maro-metal-si-sfoara-1710160462.webp?v=1740400414","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51813421646091,"created_at":"2025-02-24T14:33:32+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T14:33:34+02:00","product_id":9757199008011,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-roata-3xe27-maro-metal-sfoara_LC1035_02.webp?v=1740400414","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757452501259,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda TIANA 78W, 3 Elipse, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Negru","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-tiana-78w-3-elipse-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-negru","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eRedefineste Atmosfera Casei Tale cu Stil si Tehnologie\u003c\/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eDescopera eleganta moderna a lustrei LED Tiana, un corp de iluminat care imbina perfect designul sofisticat cu tehnologia avansata. Cu un design circular distinctiv si finisaj elegant in negru, aceasta lustra devine rapid centrul atentiei oricarui interior modern. Cele trei surse de lumina creeaza un aspect deosebit, iar dimensiunile sale impunatoare sunt perfect adaptate pentru spatii generoase.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led.webp?v=1734528553\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eProfilul subtire de doar 9.5 cm si finisajul premium in negru adauga o nota de sofisticata oricarei incaperi, facand din aceasta lustra o alegere excelenta pentru livinguri si dormitoare moderne. Cu o putere impresionanta de 78W si un flux luminos de 6240 lumeni, lustra Gentiana acopera eficient spatii de pana la 15 metri patrati cu lumina uniforma si placuta.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/www.alessandrodesign.ro\/upload\/userfiles\/images\/documentations\/banners\/banner_iluminat_perfect.webp\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSistem de Iluminat Avansat pentru Confort Maxim\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eExperimenteaza libertatea de a-ti personaliza atmosfera cu ajutorul telecomenzii incluse. Alege intre lumina calda pentru seri relaxante, neutra pentru activitati zilnice sau rece pentru productivitate maxima. Functia de reglare a intensitatii iti permite sa creezi ambianța perfecta pentru orice moment al zilei.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/www.alessandrodesign.ro\/upload\/userfiles\/images\/documentations\/banners\/banner_telecomanda_lustra_led.webp\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTehnologia LED de ultima generatie ofera o durata de viata extinsa de 25.000 ore si un consum energetic optimizat, facand din aceasta lustra o investitie inteligenta pentru casa ta moderna.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eComfort si Functionalitate\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eSistemul dual de control combina intrerupatorul clasic cu telecomanda moderna, oferind acces facil la toate functiile avansate. Modul de noapte integrat asigura un confort vizual sporit in timpul serilor, iar protectia IP20 garanteaza siguranta in utilizare la interior.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/www.alessandrodesign.ro\/upload\/userfiles\/images\/documentations\/banners\/banner_mod_noapte_lustra_led.webp\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCu lustra LED Tiana, redescoperi placerea de a-ti transforma spatiul de locuit intr-un mediu modern, confortabil si eficient din punct de vedere energetic.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c!-- notionvc: 94b9ad08-aea2-4c93-bd40-5926fda45224 --\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T16:20:56+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T16:20:55+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","BF2025","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","SpringSale1"],"variants":[{"id":52422708494603,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT282\/3BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"219.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"279.99","position":1,"product_id":9757452501259,"created_at":"2025-09-28T22:03:28+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":61567740281099,"created_at":"2025-10-22T10:32:50+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-10-22T10:33:05+03:00","product_id":9757452501259,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a1_99281a7c-a718-4a2c-8036-437f42e1dabb.png?v=1761118385","width":1600,"height":1600},{"id":69659094515979,"created_at":"2026-07-03T14:10:55+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-07-03T14:11:00+03:00","product_id":9757452501259,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImageJul3_2026_02_10_42PM.png?v=1783077060","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69659100545291,"created_at":"2026-07-03T14:12:38+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-07-03T14:12:42+03:00","product_id":9757452501259,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImageJul3_2026_02_12_25PM.png?v=1783077162","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":51815740375307,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:20:58+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-10-22T10:33:05+03:00","product_id":9757452501259,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-gentiana-telecomanda-138w-dimabila_LL1803N_05.webp?v=1761118385","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51815740145931,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:20:58+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-10-22T10:33:05+03:00","product_id":9757452501259,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-gentiana-telecomanda-138w-dimabila_LL1803N_02.webp?v=1761118385","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51815739982091,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:20:58+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-10-22T10:33:05+03:00","product_id":9757452501259,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-gentiana-telecomanda-138w-dimabila_LL1803N_04.webp?v=1761118385","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51815739719947,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:20:58+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2025-10-22T10:33:05+03:00","product_id":9757452501259,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-gentiana-telecomanda-138w-dimabila_LL1803N_03.webp?v=1761118385","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51815739588875,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:20:58+02:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2025-10-22T10:33:05+03:00","product_id":9757452501259,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-gentiana-telecomanda-138w-dimabila_LL1803N_01.webp?v=1761118385","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69658955776267,"created_at":"2026-07-03T13:45:05+03:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2026-07-03T13:45:07+03:00","product_id":9757452501259,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Label_2548424_big_color.png?v=1783075507","width":425,"height":850},{"id":69659009941771,"created_at":"2026-07-03T13:54:27+03:00","position":10,"updated_at":"2026-07-03T13:54:31+03:00","product_id":9757452501259,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImageJul3_2026_01_54_11PM.png?v=1783076071","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69659029373195,"created_at":"2026-07-03T13:58:14+03:00","position":11,"updated_at":"2026-07-03T13:58:19+03:00","product_id":9757452501259,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImageJul3_2026_01_58_01PM.png?v=1783076299","width":1254,"height":1254}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757261562123,"title":"Lustra Forma Diamant, STRUKTUR, 3xE27, Negru, Metal","handle":"lustra-forma-diamant-geo-cluster-trio-3xe27-negru-metal","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:362\"\u003eLustra Forma Diamant STRUKTUR, un ansamblu de trei pendule, transcende simpla functionalitate de iluminat, devenind o declaratie de stil indrazneata si un magnet pentru priviri, perfecta pentru a infuza personalitate in veranda, foisor, terasa acoperita sau bucatarie.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:217\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Sculptural, Impact Asertiv:\u003c\/strong\u003e Trei abajururi din metal negru, fiecare o capodopera geometrica in forma de diamant, creeaza o compozitie suspendata ce emana o eleganta robusta si un aer distinct contemporan.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:220\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eArmonie Luminoasa Abundenta:\u003c\/strong\u003e Echipata cu trei socluri E27, aceasta lustra ofera o iluminare generoasa si uniforma, ideala pentru a defini si a incalzi zonele de socializare sau cele destinate activitatilor zilnice.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:228\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatilitate Extinsa, Integrata:\u003c\/strong\u003e Desi purtand un design modern, se adapteaza surprinzator de bine in contexte diverse, de la spatii de dining moderne la zone de relaxare rustice, aducand un echilibru vizual si functional.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"8:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProportii Echilibrate, Prezenta Marcanta:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu un diametru al fiecarui corp de 30 cm si o inaltime totala de 95 cm, pendulele ofera o prezenta impunatoare, dar nu coplesitoare, ideala pentru a crea un punct focal deasupra unei insule de bucatarie, a unei mese sau a unei zone de relaxare.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:166\"\u003eAceasta lustra nu doar raspandeste lumina, ci creeaza o atmosfera vibranta si plina de caracter, transformand orice incapere intr-un spatiu memorabil si plin de stil.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T15:11:22+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T15:11:21+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Industrial","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre cu bec","Lustre din fier","Lustre Minimaliste"],"variants":[{"id":52429870596363,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-CH1A-HT2L-6630\/3R","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"139.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"119.99","position":1,"product_id":9757261562123,"created_at":"2025-09-30T17:45:42+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51814052823307,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:11:25+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T15:11:27+02:00","product_id":9757261562123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-diamant-3xe27-negru-metal-6630-3r_PE1230_01.webp?v=1740402687","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51814052593931,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:11:25+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T15:11:27+02:00","product_id":9757261562123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-diamant-3xe27-negru-metal-6630-3r_PE1230_02.webp?v=1740402687","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51814052659467,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:11:25+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T15:11:27+02:00","product_id":9757261562123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-diamant-3xe27-negru-metal-6630-3r_PE1230_03.webp?v=1740402687","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51814052757771,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:11:25+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T15:11:27+02:00","product_id":9757261562123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-diamant-3xe27-negru-metal-6630-3r_PE1230_04.webp?v=1740402687","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51814052725003,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:11:25+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T15:11:27+02:00","product_id":9757261562123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-diamant-3xe27-negru-metal-6630-3r_PE1230_05.webp?v=1740402687","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51814052692235,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:11:25+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T15:11:27+02:00","product_id":9757261562123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-diamant-3xe27-negru-metal-6630-3r_PE1230_06.webp?v=1740402687","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10153222635787,"title":"Proiector LED Reglabil FISSO Camilla, 48W, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra 3000K\/4000K\/6000K, Auriu Lucios, Metal si Acril","handle":"lustra-led-cu-proiector-reglabil-fisso-camilla-48w-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-auriu-lucios","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:269\"\u003eLustra LED cu proiector reglabil \u003cstrong\u003eCamilla \u003c\/strong\u003eeste o piesă de iluminat modernă și elegantă, îmbinând funcționalitatea iluminării direcționate cu un finisaj auriu lucios care adaugă o notă de sofisticare. Cu o putere de \u003cstrong\u003e48W\u003c\/strong\u003e, oferă o iluminare versatilă pentru diverse spații.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:269\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:256\"\u003eSimilar modelului Berta, această lustră dispune de unul sau mai multe proiectoare LED reglabile, permițându-ți să orientezi lumina acolo unde ai cea mai mare nevoie. Acest lucru este ideal pentru a evidenția elemente de decor, zone de lectură sau de lucru.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:256\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:231\"\u003ePuterea de \u003cstrong\u003e48W\u003c\/strong\u003e sugerează o iluminare potrivită pentru camere de dimensiuni medii. De asemenea, este probabil să ofere posibilitatea de a alege între lumină rece, caldă sau neutră, pentru a adapta atmosfera în funcție de preferințe.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:171\"\u003eFinisajul auriu lucios adaugă un element de lux și căldură designului, făcând-o potrivită pentru interioare moderne, clasice sau eclectice unde se dorește un accent auriu.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-04-29T18:12:10+03:00","created_at":"2025-04-28T02:11:09+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED","tags":["active","All Stock","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED Scandinave"],"variants":[{"id":52424953200907,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LL830\/1GD","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"159.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"159.99","position":1,"product_id":10153222635787,"created_at":"2025-09-29T18:27:22+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69606677250315,"created_at":"2026-06-26T17:37:52+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-06-26T17:40:20+03:00","product_id":10153222635787,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/bc8d7d5e-5158-4546-9f07-b6a4b4814dcc.webp?v=1782484820","width":500,"height":500},{"id":64441875136779,"created_at":"2026-01-16T14:00:58+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T09:29:49+03:00","product_id":10153222635787,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/90f4c1b7-7300-4fd5-b3a3-08e5694750be.png?v=1778740189","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":66207957188875,"created_at":"2026-02-22T15:57:20+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T09:31:44+03:00","product_id":10153222635787,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LL830_1GD.webp?v=1778740304","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":55484813476107,"created_at":"2025-05-16T12:09:23+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-01-16T13:51:41+02:00","product_id":10153222635787,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-camilla-24w-acril-metal-alb-auriu_LL1673_02_3b82ae79-636c-4340-a87c-05420cce9c7e.webp?v=1768564301","width":900,"height":900},{"id":55484813869323,"created_at":"2025-05-16T12:09:23+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-01-16T13:51:41+02:00","product_id":10153222635787,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-camilla-24w-acril-metal-alb-auriu_LL1673_03_bc03aded-8b56-44a7-8193-e88b6ac12094.webp?v=1768564301","width":900,"height":900},{"id":63005548544267,"created_at":"2025-12-04T16:25:20+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-01-16T13:51:41+02:00","product_id":10153222635787,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LL8301BK_1_d323ac20-a89a-42ce-a6ea-a2c98463528c.png?v=1768564301","width":1586,"height":1586},{"id":68887361978635,"created_at":"2026-05-14T09:31:59+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T09:32:05+03:00","product_id":10153222635787,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage14mai2026_09_31_06.png?v=1778740325","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":68887580508427,"created_at":"2026-05-14T09:45:12+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T09:45:16+03:00","product_id":10153222635787,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage14mai2026_09_38_46.png?v=1778741116","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":62529759772939,"created_at":"2025-11-20T19:10:46+02:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2026-01-16T14:03:07+02:00","product_id":10153222635787,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LL830_1GD_EPREL_1dcc0604-24ff-41bf-b76b-509c12fdff8b.png?v=1768564987","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757292036363,"title":"Lustra Vintage CORDA, 1xE27, Rustic, Sfoara si Metal, 100cm, Suport Negru","handle":"lustra-vintage-corda-1xe27-rustic-sfoara-si-metal-100cm-suport-negru","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eLustra Vintage CORDA nu este doar un simplu corp de iluminat, ci o piesa de accent care infuzeaza atmosfera cu o caldura naturala, perfecta pentru a sublinia caracterul unic al foisorului, terasei, bucatariei sau verandei tale.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:250\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEsenta Rustica, Detaliu Modern:\u003c\/strong\u003e Construita dintr-o impletitura robusta de sfoara, ce se impleteste armonios cu elemente metalice, aceasta lustra aduce un echilibru vizual intre traditional si contemporan, evocand o senzatie de confort autentic.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:262\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLumina Unica, Atmosfera Intima:\u003c\/strong\u003e Echipata cu un singur soclu E27, CORDA Vintage creeaza o lumina focalizata si primitoare, ideala pentru a accentua zone specifice sau pentru a genera o ambianta relaxanta, fie ca este in interior sau in exteriorul acoperit.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:247\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatilitate Fara Limite:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu o lungime de 100 cm, ofera flexibilitate in amplasare, permitandu-ti sa personalizezi inaltimea si sa adaptezi lumina la nevoile specifice ale spatiului, de la iluminatul unei mese la cel al unui colt de lectura.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"8:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConstructie Rezistenta, Simplitate Eleganta:\u003c\/strong\u003e Materialele durabile asigura o longevitate remarcabila, in timp ce designul sau nepretentios, dar plin de personalitate, o transforma intr-un element decorativ ce vorbeste de la sine.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:180\"\u003eLustra Vintage CORDA nu doar lumineaza functional, ci imbratiseaza spatiul cu un spirit boem-rustic, transformand orice incapere intr-un loc cu poveste si un farmec inconfundabil.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-candelabre-bec-e27.jpg?v=1747387419\"\u003e\u003cimg\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T15:27:17+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T15:27:16+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Vintage","tags":["active","All Stock","ciresar","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre cu bec","Lustre Vintage"],"variants":[{"id":52429654425867,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LV100\/92","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"17.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"14.59","position":1,"product_id":9757292036363,"created_at":"2025-09-30T16:55:40+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51814384730379,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:27:19+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T11:46:00+03:00","product_id":9757292036363,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-harper-1xe27-maro-metal-sfoara-sf01_LC1009_02.webp?v=1778748360","width":711,"height":711},{"id":68894474797323,"created_at":"2026-05-14T11:35:06+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T11:36:58+03:00","product_id":9757292036363,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-harper-1xe27-maro-metal-sfoara-sf01_LC1009_02_1.webp?v=1778747818","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":68894822203659,"created_at":"2026-05-14T11:37:15+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T11:39:57+03:00","product_id":9757292036363,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-harper-1xe27-maro-metal-sfoara-sf01_LC1009_02_1_b9ca67dd-1748-473d-83bf-3abfd2b573eb.webp?v=1778747997","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51814384632075,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:27:19+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T11:31:50+03:00","product_id":9757292036363,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-harper-1xe27-maro-metal-sfoara-sf01_LC1009_01.webp?v=1778747510","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51814385254667,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:27:19+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T11:34:55+03:00","product_id":9757292036363,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-harper-1xe27-maro-metal-sfoara-sf01_LC1009_03.webp?v=1778747695","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":68894977753355,"created_at":"2026-05-14T11:41:12+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T11:41:15+03:00","product_id":9757292036363,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage14mai2026_11_41_04.png?v=1778748075","width":1254,"height":1254}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9760649478411,"title":"Lustra LED Liniara FANTAS 60W 120cm Lumina Rece Alb","handle":"lampa-led-liniara-fantas-60w-120cm-lumina-rece-alb","body_html":"\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eModernizați iluminatul în orice spațiu cu Lampa LED Liniară FANTAS, o alegere excelentă pentru eficiență și stil în iluminatul contemporan. Cu o putere impresionantă de 60W și o lungime de 120cm, FANTAS este perfectă pentru a oferi o iluminare puternică și uniformă în birouri, spații comerciale, bucătării sau ateliere. Designul său ultra-slim, cu o lățime de doar 7.5cm și o înălțime redusă de 2cm, adaugă un aspect minimalist și modern, fiind ideal pentru spații cu un design interior curat și aerisit.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUnul dintre cele mai remarcabile avantaje ale Lămpii LED Liniare FANTAS este lumina sa rece, care oferă un flux luminos de 4800lm. Aceasta asigură o iluminare clară și concentrată, ideală pentru zonele de lucru sau orice alte spații care necesită un nivel ridicat de lumină pentru eficiență și confort. Lumina rece contribuie la crearea unui mediu de lucru energizant și focusat, fiind preferată pentru activitățile care necesită atenție sporită la detalii.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDesignul compact și subtil al FANTAS o face ușor de integrat în diverse locații, fără a ocupa spațiu prețios sau a distruge estetica spațiului. Simplitatea și eleganța designului sunt complementate de finisarea în alb, adăugând un element de rafinament vizual în orice decor.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eLampa LED Liniară FANTAS nu doar că excelează în design și funcționalitate, dar este și o soluție ecologică datorită eficienței energetice și duratei de viață îndelungate a tehnologiei LED. Este o investiție inteligentă pentru cei care caută o iluminare de calitate, cu un impact redus asupra mediului și costurilor energetice.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAlegeți Lampa LED Liniară FANTAS pentru o soluție de iluminat eficientă, modernă și durabilă, care îmbunătățește orice spațiu cu claritatea și stilul său. Este mai mult decât o sursă de lumină; este un upgrade estetic și funcțional pentru orice spațiu contemporan.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-25T03:02:43+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-25T03:02:43+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Plafoniere LED","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Plafoniere LED"],"variants":[{"id":52424119091467,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-CH1A-HT2L-201\/60W","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"79.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"79.99","position":1,"product_id":9760649478411,"created_at":"2025-09-29T13:46:01+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51852574982411,"created_at":"2025-02-25T03:02:45+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-25T03:02:47+02:00","product_id":9760649478411,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lampa-led-liniara-layne-60w-120cm-lumina-rece-alb-1706194155.webp?v=1740445367","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51852576489739,"created_at":"2025-02-25T03:02:45+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-02-25T03:02:47+02:00","product_id":9760649478411,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lampa-led-liniara-layne_201-60w_02-1706194156.webp?v=1740445367","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9759842140427,"title":"Lustra LED cu cristal ARIELLA 39W, Rotunda, Lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Negru","handle":"lustra-led-cu-cristal-ariella-39w-rotunda-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-negru","body_html":"\u003cdiv class=\"paragrafe-text\"\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003eDescoperă lustra LED ARIELLA unde eleganța modernă întâlnește rafinamentul. Creată pentru a aduce un aer sofisticat, această piesă de design combină funcționalitatea LED-urilor cu un accent de strălucire datorită detaliilor din cristale, oferind o atmosferă unică și luminozitate ideală pentru orice spațiu mic.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\" class=\"containerimg-mobile\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"paragrafe-text\"\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003eCu o putere de \u003cstrong\u003e39W\u003c\/strong\u003e și un flux luminos de 3120lm, lustra LED \u003cstrong\u003eARIELLA \u003c\/strong\u003eeste ideală pentru încăperi de până la 10 metri pătrați, asigurând o iluminare clară și eficientă. Tehnologia LED integrată și cristalele care reflectă lumina în mod subtil fac din ARIELLA o alegere remarcabilă pentru spații mici, cum ar fi holuri și dresinguri. Bucură-te de flexibilitatea \u003cstrong\u003etrei tipuri de lumină\u003c\/strong\u003e integrate, adaptabile oricărei atmosfere:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"9:1-12:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:80\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRece (alb):\u003c\/strong\u003e Ideală pentru activități care necesită concentrare și energie.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:95\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCaldă (galben):\u003c\/strong\u003e Creează un ambient primitor și relaxant, perfect pentru serile liniștite.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"11:1-12:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNeutră:\u003c\/strong\u003e O lumină echilibrată, potrivită pentru utilizarea zilnică.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"paragrafe-text\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003ePartea centrală a lustrei ARIELLA este un cerc decorat cu cristale ce adaugă o notă de lux și rafinament, captând și reflectând lumina într-un mod spectaculos. Cu un design alb și negru mat, ARIELLA se integrează perfect în decoruri moderne și minimaliste, aducând un contrast vizual plăcut și un plus de stil.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-25T00:50:06+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-25T00:50:06+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED","tags":["active","All Stock","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate"],"variants":[{"id":52429461029131,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LL602BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"130.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"130.99","position":1,"product_id":9759842140427,"created_at":"2025-09-30T16:26:01+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69858251243787,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:55:11+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:55:15+03:00","product_id":9759842140427,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/005_05_LL602BK.webp?v=1785524115","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69858251145483,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:55:11+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:55:14+03:00","product_id":9759842140427,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/002_02_LL602BK.webp?v=1785524114","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69858251211019,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:55:11+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:55:14+03:00","product_id":9759842140427,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/004_04_LL602BK.webp?v=1785524114","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69858251440395,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:55:11+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:55:14+03:00","product_id":9759842140427,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/011_11_LL602BK.webp?v=1785524114","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69858251276555,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:55:11+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:55:14+03:00","product_id":9759842140427,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/006_06_LL602BK.webp?v=1785524114","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69858251309323,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:55:11+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:55:14+03:00","product_id":9759842140427,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/007_07_LL602BK.webp?v=1785524114","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69858251342091,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:55:11+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:55:15+03:00","product_id":9759842140427,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/008_08_LL602BK.webp?v=1785524115","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69858251374859,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:55:11+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:55:14+03:00","product_id":9759842140427,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/009_09_LL602BK.webp?v=1785524114","width":1254,"height":1254}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10239202754827,"title":"Lustra LED cu Telecomanda KARINA, 68W, 10 Elemente, Lumina Calda\/Rece\/Neutra, Dimabila, Auriu","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomnda-karina-68w-10-elemente-lumina-calda-rece-neutra-dimabila-auriu","body_html":"\u003cdiv class=\"presented-response-container ng-tns-c3304092847-190\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container-content ng-tns-c3304092847-190\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"response-content ng-tns-c3304092847-190\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color\" style=\"--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;\" id=\"model-response-message-contentr_a06f6a43b80c213d\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLustra LED KARINA, o piesa de iluminat ce imbina estetica moderna cu functionalitatea avansata. Conceputa pentru a adauga o nota de rafinament si un efect vizual deosebit, aceasta lustra este mai mult decat o sursa de lumina, este o declaratie de stil.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led.webp?v=1734528553\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIluminare Personalizabila \u0026amp; Puternica:\u003c\/strong\u003e Beneficiati de o putere totala de \u003cstrong\u003e68W \u003c\/strong\u003esi un flux luminos generos de \u003cstrong\u003e2963lm\u003c\/strong\u003e. Alegeti din cele trei temperaturi de culoare (calda, neutra, rece) si controlati lumina intuitiv, fie prin intrerupatorul clasic, fie prin telecomanda.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEficienta Energetica \u0026amp; Durabilitate:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tehnologia LED avansata asigura un consum optim si o durata de viata remarcabila de 25.000 de ore, oferind performanta pe termen lung si o intretinere minima.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLustra LED KARINA este solutia ideala pentru cei ce cauta o iluminare eficienta, estetica si durabila, transformand fiecare incapere intr-un spatiu plin de personalitate si un confort vizual exceptional, perfect pentru dormitor sau living.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-footer gap complete\"\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!