347,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/005_05_LT073-6BK.webp?v=1785530217","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69858441789707,"created_at":"2026-07-31T23:36:54+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T23:36:57+03:00","product_id":9757816750347,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/006_06_LT073-6BK.webp?v=1785530217","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69858441822475,"created_at":"2026-07-31T23:36:54+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T23:36:56+03:00","product_id":9757816750347,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/007_07_LT073-6BK.webp?v=1785530216","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69858441855243,"created_at":"2026-07-31T23:36:54+03:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T23:36:57+03:00","product_id":9757816750347,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/008_08_LT073-6BK.webp?v=1785530217","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69858441953547,"created_at":"2026-07-31T23:36:54+03:00","position":10,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T23:36:57+03:00","product_id":9757816750347,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/011_11_LT073-6BK.webp?v=1785530217","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69858441986315,"created_at":"2026-07-31T23:36:54+03:00","position":11,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T23:36:56+03:00","product_id":9757816750347,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/012_12_LT073-6BK.webp?v=1785530216","width":1254,"height":1254}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10153226993931,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda si cristal GUIDA 48W, 8 Elemente, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Negru Auriu","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-si-cristal-guida-48w-8-elemente-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-negru-auriu","body_html":"\u003cdiv class=\"chat-history-scroll-container\" id=\"chat-history\"\u003e\u003cdiv id=\"4583628c0ac5888f\" class=\"conversation-container message-actions-hover-boundary tts-removed ng-star-inserted\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container ng-tns-c3043829428-86 response-container-with-gpi tts-removed ng-star-inserted response-container-has-multiple-responses\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"presented-response-container ng-tns-c3043829428-86\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container-content ng-tns-c3043829428-86\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-content ng-tns-c3043829428-86\"\u003e\u003cdiv dir=\"ltr\" id=\"model-response-message-contentr_4583628c0ac5888f\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel stronger\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:71\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEleganță Organică și Control Modern: Lustra LED cu Telecomandă GUIDA \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:71\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:324\"\u003eÎmbracă-ți spațiul cu un design inspirat de natură și o tehnologie inteligentă cu lustra LED GUIDA . Elementele sale stilizate, sugerând \u003cstrong\u003eramuri\u003c\/strong\u003e, sunt finisate într-o combinație sofisticată de \u003cstrong\u003eauriu\u003c\/strong\u003e și \u003cstrong\u003enegru\u003c\/strong\u003e, creând un aspect modern și atrăgător, perfect pentru interioarele contemporane cu o notă de originalitate.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:324\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:237\"\u003eCu o putere de \u003cstrong\u003e46W\u003c\/strong\u003e, această lustră LED oferă o iluminare eficientă și plăcută. Datorită \u003cstrong\u003etelecomenzii incluse\u003c\/strong\u003e, ai control total asupra luminii, putând ajusta intensitatea luminoasă pentru a crea atmosfera perfectă în orice moment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:237\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:237\"\u003eDeși descrierea nu menționează temperatura culorii, este posibil ca, fiind o lustră LED cu telecomandă, să ofere opțiunea de a schimba între lumină caldă, rece și neutră. Verifică specificațiile produsului pentru această funcționalitate.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:25\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCaracteristici Cheie:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"13:1-19:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:76\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Organic Modern:\u003c\/strong\u003e Elemente stilizate de ramuri în auriu și negru.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"14:1-14:54\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePutere Eficientă:\u003c\/strong\u003e 46W pentru o iluminare optimă.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:67\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTelecomandă Inclusă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Control facil al intensității luminoase.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"16:1-16:112\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePosibilă Temperatură Culoare Variabilă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Caldă, Rece și Neutră.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"17:1-17:64\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMateriale de Calitate:\u003c\/strong\u003e Metal durabil cu finisaje elegante.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"18:1-19:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStil Contemporan cu Accente Naturale:\u003c\/strong\u003e Se integrează perfect în interioarele moderne și eclectice.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"20:1-20:14\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeneficii:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"22:1-27:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"22:1-22:73\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eControl Facil al Luminii:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ajustează intensitatea fără a te deplasa.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"23:1-23:86\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAspect Estetic Unic:\u003c\/strong\u003e Designul inspirat de natură adaugă originalitate spațiului.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"24:1-24:81\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEficiență Energetică LED:\u003c\/strong\u003e Consum redus de energie și durată de viață lungă.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"25:1-25:86\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUșor de Integrat:\u003c\/strong\u003e Designul modern se potrivește în diverse amenajări interioare.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"26:1-27:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCreează Ambianta Dorită:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ajustează lumina pentru diferite activități și momente.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"28:1-28:213\"\u003eLustra LED cu telecomandă GUIDA  este alegerea ideală pentru a adăuga un plus de stil, confort și originalitate în casa ta. Bucură-te de iluminarea modernă și de controlul inteligent, completate de un design inedit!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-04-29T18:13:54+03:00","created_at":"2025-04-28T02:33:00+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52424953397515,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT600\/9BKGD","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"339.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"399.99","position":1,"product_id":10153226993931,"created_at":"2025-09-29T18:27:24+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69623323328779,"created_at":"2026-06-30T10:38:01+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-24T11:51:31+03:00","product_id":10153226993931,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_telecomanda_si_cristal_GUIDA_48W_8_Elemente_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Negru_Auriu1.webp?v=1784883091","width":800,"height":800},{"id":57525187019019,"created_at":"2025-07-22T09:24:14+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-07-24T11:51:40+03:00","product_id":10153226993931,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_telecomanda_si_cristal_GUIDA_48W_8_Elemente_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Negru_Auriu_2a1_c8fd824f-28fb-45d4-b96a-c743a1fba2f6.png?v=1784883100","width":1500,"height":1500},{"id":62998748233995,"created_at":"2025-12-04T14:00:54+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-07-24T11:51:50+03:00","product_id":10153226993931,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_telecomanda_si_cristal_GUIDA_48W_8_Elemente_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Negru_Auriu_3.png?v=1784883110","width":1586,"height":1586},{"id":57347617947915,"created_at":"2025-07-14T11:42:35+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-07-24T11:51:59+03:00","product_id":10153226993931,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_telecomanda_si_cristal_GUIDA_48W_8_Elemente_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Negru_Auriu_4.png?v=1784883119","width":1500,"height":1500},{"id":62998748004619,"created_at":"2025-12-04T14:00:53+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-07-24T11:52:08+03:00","product_id":10153226993931,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/