08T13:02:54+03:00","product_id":10153204285707,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/8._SPECIFICATION_3bbd6105-20ae-4301-b557-ce13c494a252.png?v=1778234574","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":68771777577227,"created_at":"2026-05-08T13:02:50+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-05-08T13:02:55+03:00","product_id":10153204285707,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/12._PLACE_1_df0b6f9b-a6a9-4dbb-820a-caaa122854b7.png?v=1778234575","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":68771777544459,"created_at":"2026-05-08T13:02:50+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-05-08T13:02:54+03:00","product_id":10153204285707,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/13._PLACE_2_f7ccb070-baef-41b1-b67e-c4145a9da580.png?v=1778234574","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":68771777609995,"created_at":"2026-05-08T13:02:50+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-05-08T13:02:54+03:00","product_id":10153204285707,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/14._PLACE_3_cc2d885e-9af3-424d-8fcf-0af339cb913f.png?v=1778234574","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":63330245640459,"created_at":"2025-12-12T13:55:54+02:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2025-12-12T13:55:58+02:00","product_id":10153204285707,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LL830_2GD_EPREL.png?v=1765540558","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757538648331,"title":"Lustra LED CAROLINA 31W, 2 Elemente, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Negru","handle":"lustra-led-carolina-50w-2-elemente-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-negru","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLustra LED cu telecomandă CAROLINA, de 50W, este o opțiune de iluminat modernă și stilată, definită de un design echilibrat cu două elemente negre elegante. Această lustră îți oferă control asupra atmosferei luminoase, permițându-ți să selectezi temperatura de culoare ideală dintre rece, caldă sau neutră, pentru a se potrivi stării tale sau activității desfășurate. Datorită funcției de dimare, pe care o poți controla cu telecomanda inclusă, poți ajusta intensitatea luminii pentru a crea exact ambianța dorită. Aspectul său minimalist și culoarea neagră îi conferă un aer sofisticat, făcând-o potrivită pentru diverse încăperi, de la livinguri la dormitoare, unde se dorește un iluminat funcțional, dar și un element de design cu personalitate. Cu o putere de 50W, asigură o iluminare eficientă și plăcută a spațiului.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led.webp?v=1734528553\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-07-03T17:41:05+03:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T16:49:04+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED","tags":["active","All Stock","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52423878836491,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT235\/2","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"119.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"119.99","position":1,"product_id":9757538648331,"created_at":"2025-09-29T12:05:17+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51816317452555,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:49:06+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-03T17:34:01+03:00","product_id":9757538648331,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-carolina-cu-telecomanda-62w-negru-cu-alb-dimabila-1686730555.webp?v=1783089241","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69659756495115,"created_at":"2026-07-03T17:34:27+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-07-03T17:37:03+03:00","product_id":9757538648331,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-carolina-cu-telecomanda-62w-negru-cu-alb-dimabila-1686730555_7a1a19c4-6c8f-4d9e-9ffe-69d37be064dc.webp?v=1783089423","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69659757084939,"created_at":"2026-07-03T17:34:33+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-07-03T17:38:55+03:00","product_id":9757538648331,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-carolina-cu-telecomanda-62w-negru-cu-alb-dimabila-1686730555_17200cb6-3b54-47bf-a625-1508807e6323.webp?v=1783089535","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69659735195915,"created_at":"2026-07-03T17:30:03+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-07-03T17:30:06+03:00","product_id":9757538648331,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage3iul.2026_17_29_48.png?v=1783089006","width":1254,"height":1254}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757250322699,"title":"Lustra Forma Cub, STRUKTUR Linear Trio, 3x E27, Negru, Metal","handle":"lustra-forma-cub-struktura-linear-trio-3x-e27-negru-metal","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:325\"\u003eLustra Forma Cub STRUKTUR Linear Trio nu este doar un corp de iluminat, ci o declaratie arhitecturala suspendata, menita sa devina punctul focal in dormitor, living sau bucatarie, transformand fiecare zona intr-un spatiu cu personalitate.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:220\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Minimalist, Impact Maximum:\u003c\/strong\u003e Trei abajururi cubice din metal negru, suspendate armonios de o bara liniara, creeaza un joc vizual de plin si gol, aducand o estetica industriala subtila si o alura contemporana.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:257\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIluminare Versatila si Bine Proportii:\u003c\/strong\u003e Echipata cu trei socluri \u003cstrong\u003eE27\u003c\/strong\u003e, aceasta lustra ofera o lumina echilibrata si eficienta, perfecta pentru a ilumina o insula de bucatarie, o masa de dining sau pentru a crea o ambianta primitoare in zona de relaxare.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:189\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePrezenta Eleganta, Durabilitate Asigurata:\u003c\/strong\u003e Realizata din metal robust si suspendata elegant pe lanturi, garanteaza o longevitate remarcabila, pastrandu-si estetica impecabila in timp.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"8:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAdaptabilitate Urbana:\u003c\/strong\u003e Desi purtand un design clasic modern, se integreaza fara efort intr-o multitudine de decoruri, de la interioare urbane si minimaliste la cele cu accente industriale, aducand intotdeauna o nota de distinctie.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:181\"\u003eAceasta lustra nu doar lumineaza functional, ci modeleaza spatiul cu o prezenta sculptata, transformand fiecare incapere intr-un loc cu stil, personalitate si o lumina inspiratoare.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:181\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e*Becurile nu sunt incluse!\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:181\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-candelabre-bec-e27.jpg?v=1747387419\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T15:04:17+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T15:04:16+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Industrial","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre cu bec","Lustre din fier","Lustre Minimaliste"],"variants":[{"id":52408091115787,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-CH1A-HT2L-528\/3L","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"139.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"139.99","position":1,"product_id":9757250322699,"created_at":"2025-09-24T12:13:26+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":62652353741067,"created_at":"2025-11-24T15:02:30+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-11-24T15:02:52+02:00","product_id":9757250322699,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPT_Image_Nov_24_2025_03_02_12_PM.png?v=1763989372","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51813914968331,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:04:19+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-11-24T15:02:57+02:00","product_id":9757250322699,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-fedra-3xe27-metal-negru_PE1238_04.webp?v=1763989377","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51813914870027,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:04:19+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-11-24T15:03:00+02:00","product_id":9757250322699,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-fedra-3xe27-metal-negru_PE1238_02.webp?v=1763989380","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51813915132171,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:04:19+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-11-24T15:03:00+02:00","product_id":9757250322699,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-fedra-3xe27-metal-negru_PE1238_03.webp?v=1763989380","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51813914771723,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:04:19+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-11-24T15:03:00+02:00","product_id":9757250322699,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-fedra-3xe27-metal-negru_PE1238_05.webp?v=1763989380","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51813914706187,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:04:19+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-11-24T15:03:00+02:00","product_id":9757250322699,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-fedra-3xe27-metal-negru_PE1238_06.webp?v=1763989380","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51813915099403,"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:04:19+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2025-11-24T15:03:00+02:00","product_id":9757250322699,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/pendul-fedra-3xe27-metal-negru_PE1238_01.webp?v=1763989380","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757183836427,"title":"Lustra Clasica, Georgiana, 1x E27, Abajur Sticla, Negru, Metal si Sticla","handle":"lustra-clasica-georgiana-1x-e27-abajur-sticla-negru-metal-si-sticla","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:298\"\u003eLustra Georgiana nu este doar un corp de iluminat, ci un accent elegant, conceput sa imbine functionalitatea cu o estetica rafinata, perfecta pentru a crea o ambianta primitoare si stilata in orice interior.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:236\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Clasic Reinventat, Detalii Subtile:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu un abajur translucid, elegant, si un suport negru, aceasta lustra ofera o interpretare moderna a clasicului, permitand luminii sa se difuzeze intr-un mod captivant si plin de caracter.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:280\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePunct de Lumina Versatil, Atmosfera Intima:\u003c\/strong\u003e Echipata cu un singur soclu E27, Lustra Georgiana este ideala pentru a ilumina discret un hol, un colt de lectura sau pentru a servi ca sursa de lumina ambientala intr-un dormitor sau living, creand o atmosfera calda si invitanta.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:219\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePrezenta Compacta, Impresie Durabila:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu un diametru de 12 cm si o inaltime de 17 cm, se integreaza armonios chiar si in spatii restranse, oferind o solutie de iluminat eficienta si estetica fara a incarca vizual.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"8:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSimplitate si Eleganta:\u003c\/strong\u003e Designul sau minimalist permite integrarea facila intr-o multitudine de decoruri, de la cele moderne la cele mai traditionale, adaugand intotdeauna o nota de stil si rafinament.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:181\"\u003eLustra Georgiana nu doar lumineaza functional, ci imbraca spatiul cu o eleganta atemporala, transformand fiecare camera intr-un loc cu personalitate si o ambianta luminoasa subtila.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:181\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e*Becurile nu sunt incluse!\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:181\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-candelabre-bec-e27.jpg?v=1747387419\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T14:27:38+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T14:27:37+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Clasice","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre cu Abajur","Lustre cu bec"],"variants":[{"id":52422682345739,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LC110BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"49.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"49.99","position":1,"product_id":9757183836427,"created_at":"2025-09-28T21:43:34+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":52968829059339,"created_at":"2025-04-07T10:47:48+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-05-13T10:42:41+03:00","product_id":9757183836427,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LC110BK-LustraGeorgiana1xE27Negru-2.jpg?v=1778658161","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":52968829124875,"created_at":"2025-04-07T10:47:48+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-05-13T10:44:59+03:00","product_id":9757183836427,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LC110BK-LustraGeorgiana1xE27Negru-3.jpg?v=1778658299","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51813357650187,"created_at":"2025-02-24T14:27:39+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-05-13T10:43:49+03:00","product_id":9757183836427,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-georgiana-1xe27-crom-metal-cristal_LC1043_01.webp?v=1778658229","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":52968829255947,"created_at":"2025-04-07T10:47:47+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-12-05T15:30:35+02:00","product_id":9757183836427,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LC110BK-LustraGeorgiana1xE27Negru-1.jpg?v=1764941435","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":52968829321483,"created_at":"2025-04-07T10:47:48+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-12-05T15:30:35+02:00","product_id":9757183836427,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LC110BK-LustraGeorgiana1xE27Negru-4.jpg?v=1764941435","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":68866047541515,"created_at":"2026-05-13T10:42:49+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-05-13T10:46:01+03:00","product_id":9757183836427,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage13mai2026_10_42_36.png?v=1778658361","width":1024,"height":1024}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757767827723,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda KILLIAN 80W, 4 Cercuri, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Negru Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-killian-80w-4-cercuri-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-negru-alb","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:271\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLustra LED cu telecomandă \u003c\/strong\u003e, de \u003cstrong\u003e80W\u003c\/strong\u003e și cu un design modern ce include 4 cercuri concentrice, reprezintă o soluție de iluminat versatilă și elegantă pentru orice interior. Finisajul negru îi conferă un aspect sofisticat și ușor de integrat în diverse stiluri de decor.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:136\"\u003eAceastă lustră inteligentă oferă o gamă largă de opțiuni de iluminare, permițându-vă să creați atmosfera perfectă pentru fiecare moment:\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-7:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:196\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLumină reglabilă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Puteți ajusta intensitatea luminoasă (dimabilă) pentru a obține o lumină ambientală relaxantă sau o lumină puternică pentru activități care necesită mai multă vizibilitate.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"6:1-7:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTemperatură de culoare variabilă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu ajutorul telecomenzii, puteți comuta între lumină rece (ideală pentru concentrare și activități), lumină caldă (perfectă pentru relaxare și crearea unei atmosfere primitoare) și lumină neutră (o combinație echilibrată pentru utilizare generală).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:264\"\u003eTelecomanda inclusă adaugă un plus de confort, permițându-vă să controlați toate aceste funcții de la distanță. Datorită tehnologiei LED, lustra este și eficientă din punct de vedere energetic, având un consum redus de energie electrică și o durată de viață lungă.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:171\"\u003eÎn concluzie, lustra LED KILLIAN este o alegere excelentă pentru cei care caută o soluție de iluminat modernă, funcțională și cu multiple opțiuni de personalizare a luminii.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:171\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T18:13:00+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T18:12:59+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","Lustre LED Scandinave","SpringSale1"],"variants":[{"id":52417214382347,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT120\/4BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"199.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"239.99","position":1,"product_id":9757767827723,"created_at":"2025-09-27T06:18:39+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":55071772311819,"created_at":"2025-04-29T17:33:10+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-04-29T17:33:15+03:00","product_id":9757767827723,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT120_4BK-LustraLEDcutelecomandaLIBRA_82W_4Cercuri_luminaRece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Negru-1.png?v=1745937195","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":51817819046155,"created_at":"2025-02-24T18:13:02+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-04-29T17:33:15+03:00","product_id":9757767827723,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-libra-cu-telecomanda-120w-alb-cu-negru-acril-dimabila-1722856608.webp?v=1745937195","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51817819111691,"created_at":"2025-02-24T18:13:02+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-04-29T17:33:15+03:00","product_id":9757767827723,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-libra-telecomanda-120w-alb-negru-acril-dimabila_LL228_02.webp?v=1745937195","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51817819013387,"created_at":"2025-02-24T18:13:02+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-04-29T17:33:15+03:00","product_id":9757767827723,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-libra-telecomanda-120w-alb-negru-acril-dimabila_LL228_03.webp?v=1745937195","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51817819078923,"created_at":"2025-02-24T18:13:02+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-04-29T17:33:15+03:00","product_id":9757767827723,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-libra-telecomanda-120w-alb-negru-acril-dimabila_LL228_04.webp?v=1745937195","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757501358347,"title":"Plafoniera LED cu telecomanda si cristal NOVA ROTONDA RGB 82W, 4 Cercuri, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-si-cristal-nova-rotonda-rgb-82w-4-cercuri-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e“Este atât de ușor să controlezi atmosfera.”\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; width: 100%; max-width: 640px; margin: auto; padding-top: min(360px, 56.25%);\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/PRe0gjvBuDg\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; right: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\"\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e \u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eEste important sa acorzi o atentie deosebita iluminatului interior, avand in vedere faptul ca lumina sta la baza indeplinirii cu succes a tuturor obiectivelor zilnice. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eCaracterizate printr-un \u003cstrong\u003edesign indraznet, cu accente metalice si cristale fine\u003c\/strong\u003e, acestea pot completa subtil decorul unui living sau chiar decorul unei bucatarii. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eDatorita puterii impresionante si al autonomiei ce insumeaza \u003cstrong\u003e25 000 h\u003c\/strong\u003e, putem spune cu certitutine ca \u003cstrong\u003elustrele LED CIRCULIS\u003c\/strong\u003e pot emana fara griji o cantitate substantiala de lumina, pentru o perioada indelungata de timp. In ceea ce priveste tehnologia LED, este necesar sa mentionam faptul ca, in comparatie cu becurile clasice, LED-urile nu sunt daunatoare pentru mediul inconjurator, fiind confectionate din materiale sigure, non-toxice.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eNu in ultimul rand, lustrele din aceasta gama stau la baza confortului tau, ele avand capacitatea de a fi \u003cstrong\u003econtrolate printr-o telecomanda\u003c\/strong\u003e. Astfel, ai sansa de a manevra atat intensitatea, cat si tipul de lumina dispersat (calda-3000k, neutra-4000k si rece-6000k) printr-o simpla apasare de buton\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T16:34:28+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T16:34:28+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED \u0026 Cristale","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52415935971595,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title