7\"\u003e108W LED integrat\u003c\/strong\u003e. Prin \u003cstrong data-end=\"338\" data-start=\"315\"\u003etelecomanda inclusă\u003c\/strong\u003e, poți ajusta atât intensitatea luminii, cât și temperatura acesteia: \u003cstrong data-end=\"455\" data-start=\"408\"\u003e3000K (caldă), 4000K (neutră), 6000K (rece)\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"759\" data-start=\"460\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"473\" data-start=\"462\"\u003ePutere:\u003c\/strong\u003e 108W LED integrat\u003cbr data-end=\"494\" data-start=\"491\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"520\" data-start=\"496\"\u003eTemperatură culoare:\u003c\/strong\u003e 3000K \/ 4000K \/ 6000K\u003cbr data-end=\"545\" data-start=\"542\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"559\" data-start=\"547\"\u003eFuncții:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dimabilă, control complet prin telecomandă\u003cbr data-end=\"605\" data-start=\"602\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"618\" data-start=\"607\"\u003eDesign:\u003c\/strong\u003e 8 elemente moderne, finisaj auriu luxos\u003cbr data-end=\"661\" data-start=\"658\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"676\" data-start=\"663\"\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Metal + Acril\u003cbr data-end=\"693\" data-start=\"690\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"709\" data-start=\"695\"\u003eUtilizare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Living, dining, dormitor, birou, spații premium\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"901\" data-start=\"761\"\u003eAceastă lustra LED combină \u003cstrong data-end=\"814\" data-start=\"788\"\u003etehnologia inteligentă\u003c\/strong\u003e cu \u003cstrong data-end=\"838\" data-start=\"818\"\u003eeleganța clasică\u003c\/strong\u003e, transformând orice spațiu într-un punct central sofisticat.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-bann