GD --\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_2000x900_LT171-4GD.jpg?v=1785875622\" alt=\"Lustra LED cu Telecomanda LINEX, 53W, Lumina 3000K\/4000K\/6000K, Dimabila, Auriu banner\" width=\"2000\" height=\"900\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c!-- \/codex-banner:AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT171\/4GD --\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"442\" data-start=\"121\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"145\" data-start=\"121\"\u003eLustra LED LINEX\u003c\/strong\u003e combină eleganța finisajului \u003cstrong data-end=\"184\" data-start=\"175\"\u003eauriu\u003c\/strong\u003e cu tehnologia modernă de iluminat, devenind o alegere excelentă pentru interioare contemporane și rafinate. Cele \u003cstrong data-end=\"323\" data-start=\"298\"\u003e4 elemente decorative\u003c\/strong\u003e creează un design armonios, iar LED-ul integrat de \u003cstrong data-end=\"382\" data-start=\"375\"\u003e53W\u003c\/strong\u003e oferă o lumină puternică, eficientă și confortabilă vizual.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"442\" data-start=\"121\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"798\" data-start=\"444\"\u003eCu ajutorul \u003cstrong data-end=\"480\" data-start=\"456\"\u003etelecomenzii incluse\u003c\/strong\u003e, poți ajusta complet atmosfera din încăpere – atât \u003cstrong data-end=\"567\" data-start=\"532\"\u003eintensitatea luminii (dimmable)\u003c\/strong\u003e, cât și \u003cstrong data-end=\"602\" data-start=\"576\"\u003etemperatura de culoare\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"798\" data-start=\"444\"\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"606\" data-start=\"603\"\u003e• \u003cstrong data-end=\"632\" data-start=\"608\"\u003e3000K – lumină caldă\u003c\/strong\u003e, ideală pentru relaxare\u003cbr data-is-only-node=\"\" data-end=\"659\" data-start=\"656\"\u003e• \u003cstrong data-end=\"686\" dat