4506602881291,"created_at":"2026-01-19T14:12:38+02:00","position":10,"updated_at":"2026-01-19T14:12:53+02:00","product_id":10236598878475,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a3_84e2ed89-8455-484e-84cb-ede631ccf34f.png?v=1768824773","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":62878516904203,"created_at":"2025-11-30T12:23:33+02:00","position":11,"updated_at":"2026-01-19T14:12:53+02:00","product_id":10236598878475,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT720_6GD_PREL.png?v=1768824773","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10223580578059,"title":"Lustra LED suspendata cu Telecomanda RIMINI 58W, 3 Patrate, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Negru","handle":"lustra-led-suspendata-cu-telecomanda-rimini-58w-3-patrate-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-negru","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eLustra LED cu telecomanda, 58W, 3 patrate negre – un model suspendat care aduce echilibru intre forma si lumina. Structura cu 3 corpuri patrate, finisaj negru mat si insertii acrilice difuzeaza uniform lumina in incaperea ta – fie ca vorbim despre un dormitor spatios, zona de dining sau living.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eEste o \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003elustra LED dimabila cu telecomanda 3 functii\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, ce permite comutarea intre cele 3 temperaturi de culoare (calda – 3000K, neutra – 4000K, rece – 6000K) si ajustarea intensitatii in functie de context. Functioneaza atat cu telecomanda, cat si cu intrerupatorul clasic.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eO alegere potrivita daca vrei o \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003elustra LED \u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003ecare sa ofere control complet si o prezenta discreta dar bine structurata in decor. Recomandata ca \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003elustra LED cu telecomanda\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, potrivita si pentru cei care cauta \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003elustre LED pentru living\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e sau dormitor.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-10-21T21:27:03+03:00","created_at":"2025-06-06T12:56:30+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","BF2025","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","Lustre LED Suspendate"],"variants":[{"id":51770761052427,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT336\/3BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"239.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"300.00","position":1,"product_id":10223580578059,"created_at":"2025-06-23T12:09:30+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":60235132993803,"created_at":"2025-09-12T10:31:55+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-09-12T10:33:01+03:00","product_id":10223580578059,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a2_f0e3396e-ab2e-494c-b3e0-277452ad1259.png?v=1757662381","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":56191598264587,"created_at":"2025-06-06T13:01:22+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-09-12T10:33:01+03:00","product_id":10223580578059,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT335_3BK-LustraLEDsuspendatacutelecomandaRIMINI51W_3Patrate_luminaRece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Negru-1.webp?v=1757662381","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":56191598035211,"created_at":"2025-06-06T13:01:22+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-09-12T10:33:01+03:00","product_id":10223580578059,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/white-LT335_3BK-LustraLEDsuspendatacutelecomandaRIMINI51W_3Patrate_luminaRece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Negru-1.webp?v=1757662381","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":60235132698891,"created_at":"2025-09-12T10:31:50+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-09-12T10:33:01+03:00","product_id":10223580578059,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a1_ad43d953-be4f-4b87-8e5e-b42db48a7d61.png?v=1757662381","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":62528430670091,"created_at":"2025-11-20T16:21:46+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-11-20T16:21:49+02:00","product_id":10223580578059,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT336_3BK.png?v=1763648509","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10153184690443,"title":"Lustra Auriemma, 78x107cm, 12xG9, Auriu","handle":"lustra-auriemma-12x-g9-auriu","body_html":"\u003c!-- codex-banner:AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LC835GD --\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_2000x900_LC835GD.jpg?v=1785521394\" alt=\"Lustra Auriemma, 78x107cm, 12xG9, Auriu banner\" width=\"2000\" height=\"900\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c!-- \/codex-banner:AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LC835GD --\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:64\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Atomic Modern și Strălucire Elegantă: Lustra Auriemma\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:287\"\u003eAdaugă un plus de stil contemporan și o lumină captivantă în casa ta cu lustra Auriemma. Designul său unic, inspirat de structura atomică sau de o explozie stelară stilizată, prezintă o serie de brațe aurii care radiază dintr-un punct central, fiecare terminându-se cu o sferă luminoasă.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:171\"\u003eFinisajul \u003cstrong\u003eauriu\u003c\/strong\u003e elegant conferă un aer sofisticat și luxos, transformând această lustră într-un punct focal atrăgător în orice living modern, dining, dormitor sau hol.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:219\"\u003eEchipată cu \u003cstrong\u003e12 socluri G9\u003c\/strong\u003e, lustra Auriemma oferă o iluminare amplă și uniformă, creând o atmosferă caldă și primitoare. Dispunerea sferelor luminoase asigură o distribuție echilibrată a luminii în întreaga încăpere.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:25\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCaracteristici Cheie:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"13:1-18:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:122\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Atomic Modern:\u003c\/strong\u003e Brațe aurii radiind cu sfere luminoase, inspirat de structuri moleculare sau explozii stelare.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"14:1-14:65\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFinisaj Auriu Elegant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Adaugă o notă de lux și sofisticare.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:72\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIluminare Amplă:\u003c\/strong\u003e 12 socluri G9 pentru o lumină bogată și uniformă.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"16:1-16:90\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePunct Focal Modern:\u003c\/strong\u003e Un element de design statement pentru interioarele contemporane.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"17:1-18:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStil Versatil:\u003c\/strong\u003e Se integrează perfect în interioare moderne, minimaliste, art deco sau eclectice.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"19:1-19:14\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeneficii:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"21:1-26:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"21:1-21:89\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCreează un Punct Focal Modern și Elegant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Designul său unic atrage toate privirile.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"22:1-22:90\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOferă o Iluminare Amplă și Uniformă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ideală pentru a lumina eficient spații diverse.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"23:1-23:94\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAdaugă o Notă de Stil și Personalitate:\u003c\/strong\u003e Designul său distinctiv reflectă un gust modern.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"24:1-24:98\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCreează o Atmosferă Caldă și Primitoare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Lumina difuzată de sfere este plăcută și relaxantă.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"25:1-26:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUșor de Integrat:\u003c\/strong\u003e Finisajul auriu se asortează cu diverse scheme de culori.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"27:1-27:227\"\u003eLustra Auriemma este alegerea ideală pentru a adăuga un plus de stil modern, strălucire elegantă și o iluminare captivantă în casa ta. Lasă-te inspirat de designul său unic și bucură-te de atmosfera luminoasă pe care o creează!\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-04-29T18:05:13+03:00","created_at":"2025-04-28T01:43:12+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Moderne","tags":["active","All Stock","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre Clasice","Lustre Clasice Moderne","Lustre cu bec","Lustre cu bec moderne"],"variants":[{"id":52428438339851,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LC835GD","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"499.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"559.99","position":1,"product_id":10153184690443,"created_at":"2025-09-30T13:57:36+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69858160181515,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:48+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:51+03:00","product_id":10153184690443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/008_08_LC835GD.webp?v=1785521391","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69858160017675,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:48+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:51+03:00","product_id":10153184690443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/003_03_LC835GD.webp?v=1785521391","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69858160050443,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:48+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:51+03:00","product_id":10153184690443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/004_04_LC835GD.webp?v=1785521391","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69858159952139,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:48+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:51+03:00","product_id":10153184690443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/001_01_LC835GD.webp?v=1785521391","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69858160083211,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:48+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:51+03:00","product_id":10153184690443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/005_05_LC835GD.webp?v=1785521391","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69858160115979,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:48+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:51+03:00","product_id":10153184690443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/006_06_LC835GD.webp?v=1785521391","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69858160148747,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:48+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:51+03:00","product_id":10153184690443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/007_07_LC835GD.webp?v=1785521391","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69858160214283,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:48+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:51+03:00","product_id":10153184690443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/009_09_LC835GD.webp?v=1785521391","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69858160247051,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:48+03:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:51+03:00","product_id":10153184690443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/010_10_LC835GD.webp?v=1785521391","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69858160279819,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:48+03:00","position":10,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:51+03:00","product_id":10153184690443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/011_11_LC835GD.webp?v=1785521391","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69858160312587,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:48+03:00","position":11,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:51+03:00","product_id":10153184690443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/012_12_LC835GD.webp?v=1785521391","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69858160345355,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:48+03:00","position":12,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:51+03:00","product_id":10153184690443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/013_13_LC835GD.webp?v=1785521391","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69858160378123,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:48+03:00","position":13,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:51+03:00","product_id":10153184690443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/014_14_LC835GD.webp?v=1785521391","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69858160410891,"created_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:48+03:00","position":14,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T21:09:51+03:00","product_id":10153184690443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/015_15_LC835GD.webp?v=1785521391","width":1000,"height":1000}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9779349160203,"title":"Proiector cu 4xGU10 Proiectoare, Auriu, Metal și Acril","handle":"proiector-led-cu-4-proiectoare-auriu-metal-si-acril","body_html":"\u003cp data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"435\"\u003eProiectorul LED cu 4xGU10 este o soluție modernă și versatilă pentru iluminarea oricărui interior. Construit din metal și acril de înaltă calitate, oferă durabilitate, stabilitate și un aspect elegant, completat de finisajul auriu care adaugă un plus de rafinament. Sistemul cu patru spoturi direcționabile permite orientarea luminii exact acolo unde este nevoie, fiind ideal pentru living, bucătărie, hol, birou sau spații comerciale.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"795\"\u003eProdusul suportă becuri GU10 și este compatibil cu trei temperaturi de culoare: 3000K (lumina caldă), 4000K (lumina neutră) și 6000K (lumina rece), astfel încât utilizatorul poate adapta atmosfera în funcție de preferințe sau funcționalitate. Designul minimalist, combinat cu eficiența iluminării LED, asigură consum redus de energie și confort vizual optim.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"999\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eAcest proiector LED reprezintă alegerea perfectă pentru cei care doresc un corp de iluminat elegant, versatil și performant, capabil să ofere atât estetică, cât și funcționalitate într-un singur produs.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-09-15T17:11:43+03:00","created_at":"2025-03-06T18:46:16+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre cu bec moderne","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED"],"variants":[{"id":52372593443083,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LL835\/4BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"199.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"239.99","position":1,"product_id":9779349160203,"created_at":"2025-09-16T01:08:02+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":62339083895051,"created_at":"2025-11-14T11:20:29+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-11-14T11:21:08+02:00","product_id":9779349160203,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/f0b9f859-d3b0-4858-a89a-8f7001bed147.png?v=1763112068","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":59128786977035,"created_at":"2025-08-14T17:51:23+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-11-14T11:21:08+02:00","product_id":9779349160203,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a1_13a04798-3c4d-4d86-8202-a27dccaf2923.png?v=1763112068","width":2048,"height":2048},{"id":59128787042571,"created_at":"2025-08-14T17:51:23+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-11-14T11:21:08+02:00","product_id":9779349160203,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a2_342eecdf-7cb3-44b9-a762-ddbff06c606e.png?v=1763112068","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9779345948939,"title":"Lustra LOFT Chamber, 25x G9, Alb Auriu, Metal, Inaltime Reglabila, Modern","handle":"lustra-loft-chamber-25x-g9-alb-auriu-metal-inaltime-reglabila-modern","body_html":"\u003c!-- codex-banner:AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LC802\/25GD --\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_2000x900_LC802-25GD.jpg?v=1785517368\" alt=\"Lustra LOFT Chamber, 25x G9, Alb Auriu, Metal, Inaltime Reglabila, Modern banner\" width=\"2000\" height=\"900\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c!-- \/codex-banner:AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LC802\/25GD --\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong data-is-only-node=\"\" data-end=\"34\" data-start=\"0\"\u003eLustra cu bec moderna Leonardo\u003c\/strong\u003e este prevazuta cu \u003cstrong data-end=\"77\" data-start=\"53\"\u003e25 socluri de tip G9\u003c\/strong\u003e, avand un design \u003cstrong data-end=\"105\" data-start=\"95\"\u003erotund\u003c\/strong\u003e si un stil \u003cstrong data-end=\"127\" data-start=\"117\"\u003emodern\u003c\/strong\u003e. Functioneaza la o tensiune de \u003cstrong data-end=\"171\" data-start=\"159\"\u003e220–230V\u003c\/strong\u003e si se monteaza pe \u003cstrong data-end=\"231\" data-start=\"222\"\u003etavan\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eStructura este realizata din \u003cstrong data-end=\"271\" data-start=\"262\"\u003emetal\u003c\/strong\u003e si \u003cstrong data-end=\"282\" data-start=\"275\"\u003eABS\u003c\/strong\u003e, finisaj \u003cstrong data-end=\"301\" data-start=\"292\"\u003eauriu\u003c\/strong\u003e, cu \u003cstrong data-end=\"327\" data-start=\"306\"\u003einaltime de 18.5cm\u003c\/strong\u003e si \u003cstrong data-end=\"352\" data-start=\"331\"\u003ediametru de 67cm\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEste compatibila cu \u003cstrong data-end=\"397\" data-start=\"374\"\u003eintrerupator clasic\u003c\/strong\u003e, functioneaza cu \u003cstrong data-end=\"431\" data-start=\"415\"\u003elumina calda\u003c\/strong\u003e si este recomandata pentru \u003cstrong data-end=\"469\" data-start=\"459\"\u003eliving\u003c\/strong\u003e sau \u003cstrong data-end=\"486\" data-start=\"474\"\u003edormitor\u003c\/strong\u003e. Protectia este de tip \u003cstrong data-end=\"518\" data-start=\"510\"\u003eIP20\u003c\/strong\u003e, iar utilizarea este destinata \u003cstrong data-end=\"566\" data-start=\"550\"\u003einteriorului\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e*Becurile nu sunt incluse!\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-candelabre-bec-g9.jpg?v=1747387418\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-06-23T13:06:10+03:00","created_at":"2025-03-06T18:43:49+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Moderne","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre Clasice Moderne","Lustre cu bec","Lustre cu bec moderne"],"variants":[{"id":52423674462475,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LC802\/25GD","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"739.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"699.99","position":1,"product_id":9779345948939,"created_at":"2025-09-29T09:56:52+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69857954824459,"created_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:40+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:43+03:00","product_id":9779345948939,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/009_07_LC802-25GD.webp?v=1785517363","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69857954693387,"created_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:40+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:42+03:00","product_id":9779345948939,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/005_03_LC802-25GD.webp?v=1785517362","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69857954726155,"created_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:40+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:43+03:00","product_id":9779345948939,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/006_04_LC802-25GD.webp?v=1785517363","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69857954627851,"created_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:40+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:43+03:00","product_id":9779345948939,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/001_01_LC802-25GD.webp?v=1785517363","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69857954791691,"created_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:40+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:43+03:00","product_id":9779345948939,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/008_06_LC802-25GD.webp?v=1785517363","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69857954857227,"created_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:40+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:43+03:00","product_id":9779345948939,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/010_08_LC802-25GD.webp?v=1785517363","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69857954889995,"created_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:40+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:43+03:00","product_id":9779345948939,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/011_09_LC802-25GD.webp?v=1785517363","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69857954758923,"created_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:40+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:43+03:00","product_id":9779345948939,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/007_05_LC802-25GD.webp?v=1785517363","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69857954922763,"created_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:40+03:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T20:02:43+03:00","product_id":9779345948939,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/012_10_LC802-25GD.webp?v=1785517363","width":1000,"height":1000}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10851855466763,"title":"Lustra Suspendata Vintage, LV581\/6BK, 6xG9 Maro, Metal si Sfoara","handle":"lustra-suspendata-lv581-6bk-6-e27-maro-metal-si-sfoara","body_html":"\u003cp data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"70\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"70\"\u003eLustră suspendată vintage LV581\/6BK, 6x G9, maro, metal și sfoară\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"349\"\u003eLustra suspendată vintage LV581\/6BK este un corp de iluminat cu design autentic, ideal pentru interioare cu stil industrial, rustic sau retro. Structura din metal cu finisaj maro este completată de elemente din sfoară, oferind un aspect decorativ puternic și o atmosferă caldă.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"676\"\u003eEchipată cu 6 socluri tip \u003cstrong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"70\"\u003eG9\u003c\/strong\u003e, lustra asigură o iluminare amplă și bine distribuită, potrivită pentru livinguri spațioase, zone de dining, bucătării sau spații comerciale cu tematică vintage. Compatibilitatea cu diverse tipuri de becuri permite adaptarea intensității și temperaturii de culoare în funcție de ambientul dorit.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"845\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eMaterialele rezistente și designul distinct transformă această lustră într-o alegere practică și estetică, adăugând personalitate și caracter oricărui spațiu interior.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-01-09T12:47:55+02:00","created_at":"2026-01-06T17:00:04+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Vintage","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre cu bec","Lustre Vintage"],"variants":[{"id":52808357740811,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LV581\/6BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"379.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"439.99","position":1,"product_id":10851855466763,"created_at":"2026-01-06T17:00:05+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":64513489109259,"created_at":"2026-01-19T16:15:35+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-01-19T16:18:54+02:00","product_id":10851855466763,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPT_Image_Jan_19_2026_04_15_24_PM.png?v=1768832334","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":64162829173003,"created_at":"2026-01-06T17:01:20+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-01-19T16:18:54+02:00","product_id":10851855466763,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPSPhotos_1_c0a8e62e-c660-4ef4-b3ab-d2e4364721f1.jpg?v=1768832334","width":565,"height":557},{"id":64162829205771,"created_at":"2026-01-06T17:01:20+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-01-19T16:18:54+02:00","product_id":10851855466763,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPSPhotos_2_45619479-6bf0-42c0-b459-df66093285ab.jpg?v=1768832334","width":1180,"height":1138},{"id":64513617232139,"created_at":"2026-01-19T16:18:18+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-01-19T16:18:21+02:00","product_id":10851855466763,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPT_Image_Jan_19_2026_04_18_09_PM.png?v=1768832301","width":1024,"height":1024}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10840267915531,"title":"Proiector Liniar Joom 2XGU10 Alb","handle":"lustra-joom-cu-proiector-liniar-2xgu10-alb","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:312\"\u003eLustra Joom cu Proiector Liniar nu este doar un corp de iluminat, ci un instrument precis, conceput sa accentueze, sa ghideze si sa creeze ambiante dinamice in living, hol sau bucatarie.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:232\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Industrial Pur, Finisaj Mat:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu o silueta liniara, curata si un finisaj negru mat, acest proiector se integreaza fara efort in interioare moderne, industriale sau chiar eclectice, aducand o nota de sofisticare discreta.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:282\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLumina Directionata, Control Absolut:\u003c\/strong\u003e Echipata cu doua surse de lumina GU10, permite orientarea individuala a fiecarui spot, oferind flexibilitatea de a ilumina obiecte de arta, zone de lucru sau de a accentua textura peretilor, cu o lumina neutra ce reproduce fidel culorile.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:192\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDurabilitate Extinsa, Performanta Constantă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu o autonomie impresionanta de 25.000 de ore, aceasta lustra promite o prezenta luminoasa de lunga durata, fara compromisuri in performanta.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"8:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePrezenta Compacta, Impact Maximal:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu dimensiuni de 15.5 cm inaltime, 25 cm lungime si 15 cm latime, se monteaza discret pe tavan, oferind o solutie de iluminat puternica fara a incarca vizual spatiul.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:179\"\u003eLustra Joom nu doar lumineaza functional, ci redefineste modul in care percepi lumina in spatiul tau, oferind un control precis asupra atmosferei si un accent stilistic impecabil.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:179\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-candelabre-bec-gu10.jpg?v=1747387419\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e*Becurile nu sunt incluse!\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-12-29T07:18:45+02:00","created_at":"2025-12-18T11:14:51+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustra LED","tags":["active","All Stock","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre Clasice Moderne","Lustre cu bec","Lustre cu bec moderne","Plafoniere LED"],"variants":[{"id":52770902769931,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LC500\/2WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"79.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"99.99","position":1,"product_id":10840267915531,"created_at":"2025-12-18T11:14:52+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":63557295210763,"created_at":"2025-12-18T11:16:15+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-01-05T05:30:57+02:00","product_id":10840267915531,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPT_Image_Dec_18_2025_11_16_04_AM.png?v=1767583857","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":63557290066187,"created_at":"2025-12-18T11:15:13+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-01-05T05:31:01+02:00","product_id":10840267915531,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPSPhotos_1_d53db0c7-e0e8-47fd-a64d-d781341a9471.png?v=1767583861","width":469,"height":469},{"id":63557476942091,"created_at":"2025-12-18T11:46:24+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-01-05T05:31:01+02:00","product_id":10840267915531,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPS_Photos_1_6e931097-bb3f-4570-865f-c8d96072ed1e.jpg?v=1767583861","width":750,"height":750},{"id":66220364464395,"created_at":"2026-02-22T18:50:21+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-02-22T18:50:23+02:00","product_id":10840267915531,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LC500_2WH.webp?v=1771779023","width":1024,"height":1024}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10667746394379,"title":"Lustra Vintage CORDA, 1xE27, Rustic, Sfoara si Metal, 100cm, Negru","handle":"lustra-vintage-corda-1xe27-rustic-sfoara-si-metal-150cm-negru","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eLustra Vintage CORDA nu este doar un simplu corp de iluminat, ci o piesa de accent care infuzeaza atmosfera cu o caldura naturala, perfecta pentru a sublinia caracterul unic al foisorului, terasei, bucatariei sau verandei tale.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:250\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEsenta Rustica, Detaliu Modern:\u003c\/strong\u003e Construita dintr-o impletitura robusta de sfoara, ce se impleteste armonios cu elemente metalice, aceasta lustra aduce un echilibru vizual intre traditional si contemporan, evocand o senzatie de confort autentic.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:262\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLumina Unica, Atmosfera Intima:\u003c\/strong\u003e Echipata cu un singur soclu E27, CORDA Vintage creeaza o lumina focalizata si primitoare, ideala pentru a accentua zone specifice sau pentru a genera o ambianta relaxanta, fie ca este in interior sau in exteriorul acoperit.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:247\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatilitate Fara Limite:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu o lungime de 100 cm, ofera flexibilitate in amplasare, permitandu-ti sa personalizezi inaltimea si sa adaptezi lumina la nevoile specifice ale spatiului, de la iluminatul unei mese la cel al unui colt de lectura.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"8:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConstructie Rezistenta, Simplitate Eleganta:\u003c\/strong\u003e Materialele durabile asigura o longevitate remarcabila, in timp ce designul sau nepretentios, dar plin de personalitate, o transforma intr-un element decorativ ce vorbeste de la sine.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:180\"\u003eLustra Vintage CORDA nu doar lumineaza functional, ci imbratiseaza spatiul cu un spirit boem-rustic, transformand orice incapere intr-un loc cu poveste si un farmec inconfundabil.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-candelabre-bec-e27.jpg?v=1747387419\"\u003e\u003cimg\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-09-04T13:15:13+03:00","created_at":"2025-08-12T13:58:22+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Vintage","tags":["active","All Stock","ciresar","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre cu bec"