" height=\"900\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c!-- \/codex-banner:AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LC802\/15GD --\u003e\u003cp\u003eLustra cu bec moderna Leonardo este prevazuta cu \u003cstrong data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"73\"\u003e15 socluri de tip G9\u003c\/strong\u003e, avand un design \u003cstrong data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"101\"\u003erotund\u003c\/strong\u003e si stil \u003cstrong data-start=\"110\" data-end=\"120\"\u003emodern\u003c\/strong\u003e. Functioneaza la o \u003cstrong data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"164\"\u003etensiune de 220–230V\u003c\/strong\u003e si se monteaza pe \u003cstrong data-start=\"215\" data-end=\"224\"\u003etavan\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eStructura este realizata din \u003cstrong data-start=\"255\" data-end=\"271\"\u003emetal si ABS\u003c\/strong\u003e, finisaj \u003cstrong data-start=\"281\" data-end=\"290\"\u003eauriu\u003c\/strong\u003e, cu \u003cstrong data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"316\"\u003einaltime de 18.5cm\u003c\/strong\u003e si \u003cstrong data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"341\"\u003ediametru de 63 cm\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEste compatibila cu \u003cstrong data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"386\"\u003eintrerupator clasic \u003c\/strong\u003esi este recomandata pentru \u003cstrong data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"474\"\u003edining, hol sau living\u003c\/strong\u003e. Protectia este de tip \u003cstrong data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"506\"\u003eIP20\u003c\/strong\u003e, iar utilizarea este destinata \u003cstrong data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"554\"\u003einteriorului\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e*Becurile nu sunt incluse!\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-candelabre-bec-g9.jpg?v=1747387418\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-06-23T12:30:47+03:00","created_at":"2025-03-06T18:43:46+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00"