003e\n\u003cp\u003ePotrivită pentru dormitor, bucatarie sau birou\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstrucție premium din metal\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMontaj pe tavan\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecificații tehnice\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTip produs: Lustra LED decorativă\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLungime: 54 cm\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSoclu: 9 x E27\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMaterial: Metal + plastic rotomulat\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCuloare: Auriu\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTip globuri: Opal \/ alb mat\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlimentare: 220-230V\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStil: Modern \/ Luxury \/ Minimalist\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLustra ORBIT este alegerea perfectă pentru cei care doresc un corp de iluminat statement, cu design modern și accente luxoase.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:229\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-06-29T10:36:50+03:00","created_at":"2026-06-26T11:29:00+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:26+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Clasice","tags":["active","All Stock","BLACKSEASON","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Ciresar 25","Corpuri de Iluminat"],"variants":[{"id":53206750200075,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LC6008\/9GD","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"499.99","grams":0,"compar